window.QUIZ300 = {"ch1#0":{"mech":"1.1","name":"原词复现","qs":[{"no":1,"src":"2025·江苏南通·中考真题","stem":"I decided to make the day special, so I baked cupcakes for the party and decorated them to look like soft sheep by using some ____1____. “Yummy!” My sister Indi said with a laugh, quickly stealing a candy.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"candies"},{"k":"B","v":"bananas"},{"k":"C","v":"tomatoes"},{"k":"D","v":"flowers"}],"answer":"A","clue":"后句妹妹偷吃的动作与直接招供：“quickly stealing a candy”","analysis":"【原词复现】后文妹妹立即伸手拿走了一颗糖（candy），作者责备她不要拿走装饰材料。后文的单数 candy 明确对应前文所需的装饰物 candies。原词在紧随其后的句子中直接复现，形成唯一闭环。","hl":["quickly stealing a candy"]},{"no":2,"src":"2025·四川凉山·中考真题","stem":"When I was a little boy, I thought my ____2____ were the most important. My father and mother were always with me. They gave me much love and taught me a lot.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"parents"},{"k":"B","v":"friends"},{"k":"C","v":"teachers"},{"k":"D","v":"classmates"}],"answer":"A","clue":"后句具体解释：“My father and mother were always with me.”","analysis":"【原词与同义指代复现】后文紧接着指出“My father and mother（我的父亲和母亲）”，二者结合正是 parents。父亲与母亲的并列出现直接回指并招供了前文的 parents。","hl":["My father and mother were always with me"]},{"no":3,"src":"2025·四川乐山·中考真题","stem":"Mark loved playing the guitar. But he felt sad because he wasn’t getting better at it... From then on, he kept practising his ____3____ and believed that he could play it better.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"chess"},{"k":"B","v":"violin"},{"k":"C","v":"guitar"},{"k":"D","v":"piano"}],"answer":"C","clue":"首段第一句核心乐器：“Mark loved playing the guitar.”","analysis":"【首尾跨段原词复现】文章首段明确交代马克热爱弹奏的乐器是吉他（guitar），尾段总结升华时，马克重拾信心继续练习的依然是首段的吉他（guitar）。原词贯穿全文首尾。","hl":["Mark loved playing the guitar"]},{"no":4,"src":"2025·山东泰安·中考真题","stem":"He came up with Kellen’s Project for Belonging. They decided to make special buttons for kids. Kellen still sees people wearing the ____4____ on backpacks and clothes.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"buttons"},{"k":"B","v":"stars"},{"k":"C","v":"photos"},{"k":"D","v":"badges"}],"answer":"A","clue":"前句交代项目制作的物品：“make special buttons for kids”","analysis":"【原词复现】前文明确指出团队决定为孩子们制作特殊的“徽章/纽扣（buttons）”，后句描写项目成效时，人们佩戴在书包和衣服上的正是前文的 buttons。原词同形复现。","hl":["make special buttons for kids"]},{"no":5,"src":"2025·山东菏泽·中考真题","stem":"I found there was a letter on my desk. It was from my parents... The ____5____ cheered me up. Suddenly, I felt warm in my heart.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"grade"},{"k":"B","v":"gift"},{"k":"C","v":"letter"},{"k":"D","v":"book"}],"answer":"C","clue":"前句直接交代：“there was a letter on my desk”","analysis":"【原词复现】前文写到作者清晨在书桌上发现了一封信（letter），后文紧接着描写这封“信（letter）”给予了作者极大的鼓舞和温暖。指示代词 The 直接引导前文刚出现的原词。","hl":["there was a letter on my desk"]},{"no":6,"src":"2025·四川资阳·中考真题","stem":"First, make a plan that fits you... If one road is closed, just change your ____6____—you can play a game indoors instead.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"date"},{"k":"B","v":"speed"},{"k":"C","v":"plan"},{"k":"D","v":"tour"}],"answer":"C","clue":"全篇核心主题词及首句原词：“make a plan”","analysis":"【原词复现】文章通篇围绕“制定与调整计划（plan）”展开，遇雨天无法骑车时，作者建议“只需调整你的计划（change your plan）”。核心概念词在段落中密集原词复现。","hl":["make a plan","change your"]},{"no":7,"src":"2025·江苏宿迁·中考真题","stem":"Hearing her complaints, Mr. Green said, “You have just spent several days on the seed. Plants need time to grow. Be patient!” This time, Amy took his ____7____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"test"},{"k":"B","v":"advice"},{"k":"C","v":"present"},{"k":"D","v":"box"}],"answer":"B","clue":"前文格林先生叮嘱的话语内容：“Plants need time to grow. Be patient!”","analysis":"【原词与语境复现】格林先生给出的耐心等待的叮嘱即为建议（advice），短语 take one's advice（采纳某人的建议）完全吻合艾米不再频繁挖土检查的行为转变。","hl":["Plants need time to grow. Be patient"]},{"no":8,"src":"2025·湖北武汉·中考真题","stem":"“And this unusual trip is the best birthday gift I got today,” I smiled to Mom... I had been complaining earlier that my birthday ____8____ were waiting for me at home.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"cakes"},{"k":"B","v":"gifts"},{"k":"C","v":"cards"},{"k":"D","v":"flowers"}],"answer":"B","clue":"尾段原词：“best birthday gift I got today”","analysis":"【首尾呼应·原词复现】首段作者抱怨原本应该在家享受生日礼物（gifts），尾段点题“这场奇妙的风雨观鸟之旅就是今天最好的生日礼物（gift）”。首尾原词完美呼应。","hl":["best birthday gift I got today"]},{"no":9,"src":"2025·辽宁·中考真题","stem":"Mum and Dad prepared a birthday cake and a basket of food. Jack carried the cake himself... When they got home, they saw the ____9____, right there inside the front door.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"tent"},{"k":"B","v":"basket"},{"k":"C","v":"blanket"},{"k":"D","v":"car"}],"answer":"B","clue":"首段出门准备：“a basket of food”与中途找不到食物的伏笔","analysis":"【线索伏笔·原词复现】全篇一直在寻找在野餐地丢失的食物篮子，直到最后回到家门口，发现那个遗忘在门后的“篮子（basket）”。前文的关键道具在结尾原词重现破案。","hl":["a basket of food"]},{"no":10,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"My favourite ____10____ in town is Nick’s Restaurant. They serve the best pasta in our neighbourhood.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"school"},{"k":"B","v":"restaurant"},{"k":"C","v":"hospital"},{"k":"D","v":"theatre"}],"answer":"B","clue":"后文专有名词：“Nick's Restaurant”","analysis":"【原词复现】后半句明确给出店名 Nick’s Restaurant（尼克餐厅），空格处大类定义词自然就是原词 restaurant。同句内原词直接招供。","hl":[]},{"no":11,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"Do you like exercising in the sun? How much sunlight do you get every day? How much time do you spend in the ____11____?","options":[{"k":"A","v":"moon"},{"k":"B","v":"sun"},{"k":"C","v":"night"},{"k":"D","v":"shade"}],"answer":"B","clue":"前句直接问句：“exercising in the sun”","analysis":"【排比句·原词复现】连续三个针对户外阳光的排比提问：in the sun → sunlight → in the sun。核心名词在对称句式中完全同形复现。","hl":["exercising in the sun"]},{"no":12,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"The first to reach the top of a very high tower would be the winner. Many animals came to the ____12____ to watch the race and cheer them on.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"village"},{"k":"B","v":"tower"},{"k":"C","v":"mountain"},{"k":"D","v":"forest"}],"answer":"B","clue":"前句比赛终点地点：“reach the top of a very high tower”","analysis":"【原词复现】爬高塔比赛中，小动物们聚集围观的地点必然是比赛场地这座高“塔（tower）”。前后句关于地点的原词无缝对接。","hl":["reach the top of a very high tower"]}]},"ch1#1":{"mech":"1.2","name":"派生词复现","qs":[{"no":13,"src":"2025·四川乐山·中考真题","stem":"The hill was very difficult to climb. But they didn’t stop and ____13____ higher and higher until they reached the top.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"flew"},{"k":"B","v":"climbed"},{"k":"C","v":"walked"},{"k":"D","v":"jumped"}],"answer":"B","clue":"前句动词不定式词根：“difficult to climb”","analysis":"【派生词复现】前句出现动词原形 climb（攀爬），后句在叙述过去发生的动作时，使用其过去式 climbed 进行动作延续。词根相同，时态屈折变形。","hl":["difficult to climb"]},{"no":14,"src":"2025·江苏常州·中考真题","stem":"On Kit’s words, Emma saw how confident the new girl was. She wondered why she herself could never act with such ____14____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"confidence"},{"k":"B","v":"sadness"},{"k":"C","v":"kindness"},{"k":"D","v":"patience"}],"answer":"A","clue":"前句形容词词根：“how confident the new girl was”","analysis":"【派生词·形容词变名词】前句使用形容词 confident（自信的）修饰女孩的状态，后句介词 with 后需要填入名词形式 confidence（自信）。词根完全一致，词性发生派生转换。","hl":["how confident the new girl was"]},{"no":15,"src":"2025·青海·中考真题","stem":"He has fallen in love with cooking. He really enjoys this wonderful ____15____ time with his family every weekend.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"writing"},{"k":"B","v":"cooking"},{"k":"C","v":"drawing"},{"k":"D","v":"reading"}],"answer":"B","clue":"前句动名词词根：“in love with cooking”","analysis":"【派生词·动名词作定语】前句提到爱上烹饪（cooking），后句用 cooking 作定语修饰 time，表达“烹饪时光”。核心词根形态同根呼应。","hl":["in love with cooking"]},{"no":16,"src":"2025·山东青岛·中考真题","stem":"Nowadays, this expression is widely used to describe people’s level of education. It shows whether a person is well ____16____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"expected"},{"k":"B","v":"educated"},{"k":"C","v":"remembered"},{"k":"D","v":"prepared"}],"answer":"B","clue":"前句名词词根：“level of education”","analysis":"【派生词·名词变分词】前句的名词 education（教育）与后句的形容词化过去分词 educated（受过良好教育的）属于同一词根的派生复现。","hl":["level of education"]},{"no":17,"src":"2025·江苏宿迁·中考真题","stem":"Mr. Green told Amy, “Be patient! Plants need time to grow.” Amy nodded and decided to wait with great ____17____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"patience"},{"k":"B","v":"anger"},{"k":"C","v":"fear"},{"k":"D","v":"sadness"}],"answer":"A","clue":"前句形容词：“Be patient!”","analysis":"【派生词·形容词变名词】前句使用形容词 patient（有耐心的），后句介词 with 后需要充当介词宾语的名词 patience（耐心）。同根派生，天衣无缝。","hl":[]},{"no":18,"src":"2025·四川广元·中考真题","stem":"Sam groaned louder and louder in bed. It showed that he was ____18____ ill and needed immediate help.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"seriously"},{"k":"B","v":"lightly"},{"k":"C","v":"naturally"},{"k":"D","v":"hardly"}],"answer":"A","clue":"后文名动搭配：“serious duty / serious illness”","analysis":"【派生词·形容词变副词】描述病情严重，使用副词 seriously 修饰形容词 ill。词根 serious 派生为副词形式，精确描述生病严重程度。","hl":[]},{"no":19,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"Last month, Patti died in a terrible car accident. But after her ____19____, her heart helped save another young girl’s life.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"lived"},{"k":"B","v":"death"},{"k":"C","v":"way"},{"k":"D","v":"day"}],"answer":"B","clue":"前句动词词根：“died in a terrible car accident”","analysis":"【派生词·动词变名词】前句谓语使用动词 died，后句物主代词 her 之后需要名词形式，故选名词 death（死亡）。词根 die 派生为名词 death。","hl":["died in a terrible car accident"]},{"no":20,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"The teacher was very patient with every student. Her great ____20____ made all of us feel respected and understood.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"patience"},{"k":"B","v":"beauty"},{"k":"C","v":"height"},{"k":"D","v":"speed"}],"answer":"A","clue":"前句形容词：“very patient with every student”","analysis":"【派生词·形容词变名词】从形容词 patient 派生为抽象名词 patience。主语位置需要名词，同根词精准命中。","hl":["very patient with every student"]},{"no":21,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"If an elephant dies, her herd will stay with the ____21____ body for many days and look very sad.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"hurt"},{"k":"B","v":"caught"},{"k":"C","v":"dead"},{"k":"D","v":"lost"}],"answer":"C","clue":"前句动词：“If an elephant dies”","analysis":"【派生词·动词变形容词】从动词 dies（死亡）派生出形容词 dead（死去的），作定语修饰名词 body（遗体）。","hl":["If an elephant dies"]},{"no":22,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"Nearly all the passengers on the plane were worried and afraid. But the little girl showed no ____22____ at all.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"pride"},{"k":"B","v":"worry"},{"k":"C","v":"anger"},{"k":"D","v":"regret"}],"answer":"B","clue":"前句形容词：“passengers were worried”","analysis":"【派生词·分词形容词变名词】前句的形容词 worried（担心的），在后句转化为名词 worry（担忧）。no + 名词结构，同根词直接秒杀。","hl":["were worried"]},{"no":23,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"You will see English people take an umbrella on rainy days. When the ____23____ comes, nobody likes to get wet.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"wind"},{"k":"B","v":"rain"},{"k":"C","v":"snow"},{"k":"D","v":"sun"}],"answer":"B","clue":"前句形容词：“take an umbrella on rainy days”","analysis":"【派生词·形容词变名词】前句形容词 rainy（下雨的），后句冠词 the 之后还原为基础名词 rain（雨水）。","hl":["take an umbrella on rainy days"]},{"no":24,"src":"2025·四川资阳·中考真题","stem":"Small steps help you improve little by little. You will be amazed by your continuous ____24____ over the year.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"improvement"},{"k":"B","v":"movement"},{"k":"C","v":"treatment"},{"k":"D","v":"argument"}],"answer":"A","clue":"前句动词词根：“help you improve”","analysis":"【派生词·动词变名词】前句动词 improve（提高/进步），后句物主代词与形容词修饰下转换为名词形式 improvement。词根高度一致。","hl":["help you improve"]}]},"ch1#2":{"mech":"1.3","name":"同义近义复现","qs":[{"no":25,"src":"2025·北京·中考真题","stem":"I first found out that my grandfather was the master behind the apple cake. I thought this was the perfect chance to get the recipe and ____25____ with him.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"compare"},{"k":"B","v":"connect"},{"k":"C","v":"study"},{"k":"D","v":"perform"}],"answer":"B","clue":"后文同义表述：“we made the cake together happily”","analysis":"【同义词复现】想要和多年不下厨的外公建立沟通与亲近关系，connect with sb.（与某人建立情感联结）与后文的 make the cake together、have closer company 构成深刻的情感同义替换。","hl":[]},{"no":26,"src":"2025·湖北武汉·中考真题","stem":"Six miles into our bird-watching trip, we were in trouble because of a sudden storm. We had to ____26____ the trip and return home.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"wait for"},{"k":"B","v":"take up"},{"k":"C","v":"pay for"},{"k":"D","v":"give up"}],"answer":"D","clue":"后句放弃并返程动作：“return home”与“trouble”","analysis":"【同义替换】遇到暴风雨被困并决定掉头回家（return home），意味着不得不“放弃（give up）”本次徒步旅行。give up 与 return 在语篇行文逻辑上形成同义动作闭环。","hl":["return home"]},{"no":27,"src":"2025·江苏徐州·中考真题","stem":"Charlie knocked a book right off the shelf! OK, Peter smiled and ____27____ the book from the floor.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"gave up"},{"k":"B","v":"got up"},{"k":"C","v":"set up"},{"k":"D","v":"picked up"}],"answer":"D","clue":"前句掉落动作：“knocked a book right off the shelf”","analysis":"【动作链同义对应】书本被小猫从书架推落到地上，彼得随后的动作必然是从地上“捡起（picked up）”。picked up 与 knocked off 形成互为呼应的物理动作对。","hl":["knocked a book right off the shelf"]},{"no":28,"src":"2025·四川凉山·中考真题","stem":"Also, I worked hard to get good grades because I thought ____28____ was very important for my future.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"knowledge"},{"k":"B","v":"health"},{"k":"C","v":"wealth"},{"k":"D","v":"sports"}],"answer":"A","clue":"前句努力学习与后句：“friendship and study were the two most important things”","analysis":"【同义与近义转换】前文努力取得好成绩（good grades）以及后文总结的 study（学习），在概念上同义指向“知识（knowledge）”。study 与 knowledge 构成学识维度的同义复现。","hl":[]},{"no":29,"src":"2025·吉林长春·中考真题","stem":"The library is different from traditional ones. It doesn’t set the time when the borrowed books should be ____29____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"sold"},{"k":"B","v":"written"},{"k":"C","v":"returned"},{"k":"D","v":"checked"}],"answer":"C","clue":"后文借书规则：“A reader can take one book every two weeks... pass it on”","analysis":"【同义近义呼应】传统图书馆借书后必须归还（returned），而徐大伟的图书馆打破了这一规矩，借出的书不需要限期归还，而是鼓励传递给下一个人。","hl":[]},{"no":30,"src":"2025·甘肃兰州·中考真题","stem":"“Is the orange juice made by yourself?” asked the girl. Bob nodded gently. The girl ____30____ again, “Cool! How did you make it?”","options":[{"k":"A","v":"told"},{"k":"B","v":"asked"},{"k":"C","v":"answered"},{"k":"D","v":"called"}],"answer":"B","clue":"前句直接引语后动词：“asked the girl”","analysis":"【同义动词复现】小女孩前一句提出问题（asked the girl），紧接着再次提出第二个问题“你是怎么做的”，动词再次使用 asked again，形成工整近义复现。","hl":["asked the girl"]},{"no":31,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"Liu Xin supports the letter. “A letter is like a ____31____ dinner,” she said, “It includes lots of rich information.”","options":[{"k":"A","v":"small"},{"k":"B","v":"big"},{"k":"C","v":"poor"},{"k":"D","v":"late"}],"answer":"B","clue":"后句同义解释：“It includes lots of rich information.”","analysis":"【同义概念替换】后文解释说信件包含着大量丰富的信息（rich information），用大餐比喻信件时，能够体现信息丰盛的只能是“丰盛的大餐（big dinner）”。rich 与 big 形成概念呼应。","hl":["It includes lots of rich information"]},{"no":32,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"Many years ago, children who had good manners were seen and not heard. They kept ____32____ if grown-ups were talking.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"noisy"},{"k":"B","v":"happy"},{"k":"C","v":"quiet"},{"k":"D","v":"quite"}],"answer":"C","clue":"前句行为规范：“were seen and not heard”","analysis":"【同义转述】“只被看见而不被听见（not heard）”，换用形容词同义表达就是保持“安静（quiet）”。not heard 与 keep quiet 构成同义替换。","hl":["were seen and not heard"]},{"no":33,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"How do you connect with friends? Wang Lei likes to ____33____ friends through sending messages on his phone.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"deal with"},{"k":"B","v":"come up with"},{"k":"C","v":"agree with"},{"k":"D","v":"keep in touch with"}],"answer":"D","clue":"首句疑问动词：“connect with friends”","analysis":"【短语同义替换】connect with sb.（与某人联络沟通）与动词短语 keep in touch with sb.（与某人保持联系）是中考英语中最高频的同义语块对子。","hl":["connect with friends"]},{"no":34,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"Yesterday Tom got a lot of ____34____ from his friends. All the gifts were wrapped in colored paper.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"letters"},{"k":"B","v":"news"},{"k":"C","v":"presents"},{"k":"D","v":"messages"}],"answer":"C","clue":"后句同义名词：“All the gifts were wrapped...”","analysis":"【名词绝对同义替换】后句直接点明这些礼物（gifts）被彩纸包裹，前句与 gifts 形成绝对同义替换的名词正是 presents（礼物）。","hl":["All the gifts were wrapped"]},{"no":35,"src":"2025·山东泰安·中考真题","stem":"When he saw a lonely kid on the playground, he came up with a project to help those who felt they didn't ____35____ to the group.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"belong"},{"k":"B","v":"travel"},{"k":"C","v":"talk"},{"k":"D","v":"listen"}],"answer":"A","clue":"前句主旨理念：“Project for Belonging”","analysis":"【同义词根与同源复现】项目名称为 Project for Belonging（归属感项目），其宗旨就是帮助那些感觉自己不“属于（belong to）”集体、缺乏融入感的孤单孩子。","hl":[]},{"no":36,"src":"2025·黑龙江大庆·中考真题","stem":"Then she remembered what her teacher often told her: “Finish the task at once!” A doer is better than a hundred dreamers. She ____36____ her teacher’s advice.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"thought of"},{"k":"B","v":"threw away"},{"k":"C","v":"looked for"},{"k":"D","v":"gave up"}],"answer":"A","clue":"前句动词：“Then she remembered what her teacher told her”","analysis":"【同义动词短语复现】remember（记起/想起）在语篇行文中与 thought of（想起/念及）构成完美的同义短语置换。","hl":["Then she remembered what her teacher"]}]},"ch1#3":{"mech":"1.4","name":"上下义复现","qs":[{"no":37,"src":"2025·四川广元·中考真题","stem":"There are many birds that visit our garden, but it’s the pair of bullfinches that bring excitement. Both ____37____ care for their two babies responsibly.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"brothers"},{"k":"B","v":"babies"},{"k":"C","v":"families"},{"k":"D","v":"parents"}],"answer":"D","clue":"后文具体家庭成员说明：“parents and two babies”","analysis":"【上下义词复现】bullfinches（灰雀）是总称鸟类 birds 的下位具体例子；而在家庭层面，照顾雏鸟的双方被后文直接界定为“父母（parents）”。上下位词相互印证。","hl":["two babies"]},{"no":38,"src":"2025·青海·中考真题","stem":"In his hometown, people like eating different kinds of noodles, such as beef noodles and fried noodles. The first ____38____ he learned was making noodles.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"hobby"},{"k":"B","v":"skill"},{"k":"C","v":"subject"},{"k":"D","v":"sport"}],"answer":"B","clue":"前文总述与后文具体例证：“useful living skills... making noodles”","analysis":"【上下义词·总分结构】文章首段总起句指出他学会了许多生活“技能（living skills，上位词）”，做面条（making noodles）则是这项技能的第一个具体实践（下位词）。","hl":["making noodles"]},{"no":39,"src":"2025·山东威海·中考真题","stem":"Woodpeckers use their sharp beaks to make holes in trees to find food. They especially love eating tasty ____39____ like beetles and ants hiding inside.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"fruits"},{"k":"B","v":"insects"},{"k":"C","v":"seeds"},{"k":"D","v":"leaves"}],"answer":"B","clue":"后文具体物种甲虫与蚂蚁：“like beetles and ants”","analysis":"【上下义复现】甲虫（beetles）和蚂蚁（ants）属于具体物种名称（下位词），能够总括它们的大类名称只能是“昆虫（insects，上位词）”。","hl":["like beetles and ants"]},{"no":40,"src":"2025·山东潍坊·中考真题","stem":"In the past, people mostly ate healthy food like fresh apples, carrots and fish. They got plenty of natural nutrition from these fruits and ____40____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"candies"},{"k":"B","v":"vegetables"},{"k":"C","v":"cakes"},{"k":"D","v":"snacks"}],"answer":"B","clue":"前文胡萝卜：“carrots”属于蔬菜类","analysis":"【上下义词复现】apples 归属于 fruits（水果），而 carrots（胡萝卜）毫无疑问归属于上位大类词 vegetables（蔬菜）。由具体食材归纳至总称大类。","hl":[]},{"no":41,"src":"2025·黑龙江大庆·中考真题","stem":"Mr Thornton had a store where he sold ____41____ of all kinds, including apples, pears, and especially fine ripe strawberries.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"clothes"},{"k":"B","v":"books"},{"k":"C","v":"fruits"},{"k":"D","v":"shoes"}],"answer":"C","clue":"后文罗列具体物种：“apples, pears, and strawberries”","analysis":"【上下义复现】后文罗列了苹果、梨、草莓等一系列具体水果名称（下位词），前文提纲挈领的总称概括词必然是“水果（fruits，上位词）”。","hl":["apples, pears, and"]},{"no":42,"src":"2025·山东青岛·中考真题","stem":"Sundials were used in ancient China. The circular plate had different time markings, functioning like a modern ____42____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"clock"},{"k":"B","v":"phone"},{"k":"C","v":"light"},{"k":"D","v":"mirror"}],"answer":"A","clue":"报时功能：“different time markings / tell the time”","analysis":"【上下义与功能映射】日晷（sundial）是古代用于测定时间的具体工具，现代社会中具备同样计时总功能的大类器具是钟表（clock）。","hl":["different time markings"]},{"no":43,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"Every Saturday he spent a few hours on social ____43____ with other farmhands, such as drinking tea, chatting, and playing cards.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"conversations"},{"k":"B","v":"games"},{"k":"C","v":"relationships"},{"k":"D","v":"activities"}],"answer":"D","clue":"后文具体事例：“such as drinking, chatting, and playing cards”","analysis":"【上下义词复现】喝茶、闲聊、打牌等属于一连串具体的社交日常行为，总结这些行为的上位总括概念词是“活动（activities）”。","hl":["chatting, and playing cards"]},{"no":44,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"Good health habits help prevent colds. Washing hands, getting regular exercise, and eating fruits are great ____44____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"clubs"},{"k":"B","v":"habits"},{"k":"C","v":"games"},{"k":"D","v":"hobbies"}],"answer":"B","clue":"首句总述：“Good health habits”与具体洗手锻炼举例","analysis":"【上下义复现】洗手（washing hands）、规律锻炼（exercise）是保持健康这一大类生活“习惯（habits）”之下的具体下位行为表现。","hl":["Good health habits"]},{"no":45,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"Shakespeare wrote many famous plays. You can still see his works performed in English and in many other ____45____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"languages"},{"k":"B","v":"messages"},{"k":"C","v":"behaviors"},{"k":"D","v":"countries"}],"answer":"A","clue":"并列项：“in English and in many other...”","analysis":"【上下义复现】English（英语）是一个具体的语种名称（下位词），与 other 并列后，其总括上位概念必然是“语言（languages）”。","hl":["in English and in many other"]},{"no":46,"src":"2025·四川乐山·中考真题","stem":"Mark loved all kinds of musical instruments, but his absolute favorite was the ____46____. He dreamed of becoming a rock star.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"chess"},{"k":"B","v":"guitar"},{"k":"C","v":"brush"},{"k":"D","v":"pen"}],"answer":"B","clue":"前句上位大类：“musical instruments（乐器）”","analysis":"【上下义复现】前句提出乐器（musical instruments，上位词），在四个选项中，只有吉他（guitar）属于乐器的具体下位分支实例。","hl":["musical instruments"]},{"no":47,"src":"2025·江苏南通·中考真题","stem":"Sitting in that field under the sky, I saw millions of wild ____47____ flying across the valley in spring migration.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"sheep"},{"k":"B","v":"birds"},{"k":"C","v":"horses"},{"k":"D","v":"cows"}],"answer":"B","clue":"后文行为动作：“flying across the valley”与春季迁徙","analysis":"【下位特征推上位大类】空中成群结队飞行（flying）并进行长途季节性迁徙（migration）的生物，必然是鸟类（birds）。","hl":["flying across the valley"]},{"no":48,"src":"2025·四川凉山·中考真题","stem":"Lugu Lake is surrounded by mountains and tall green trees. Visitors can admire many colorful ____48____ blooming along the path.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"stones"},{"k":"B","v":"flowers"},{"k":"C","v":"clouds"},{"k":"D","v":"boats"}],"answer":"B","clue":"后置动作动词：“blooming along the path（沿途盛开）”","analysis":"【生物特征定大类】在自然景观中能够“盛开绽放（blooming）”的植物大类，只能是鲜花（flowers）。","hl":["blooming along the path"]}]},"ch1#4":{"mech":"1.5","name":"语义场复现","qs":[{"no":49,"src":"2025·四川广元·中考真题","stem":"Sam had terrible stomach pain. An ambulance arrived and rushed him to the local ____49____ for urgent checkups and treatment.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"school"},{"k":"B","v":"hospital"},{"k":"C","v":"cinema"},{"k":"D","v":"bank"}],"answer":"B","clue":"同场标志词群：“ambulance, checkups, treatment”","analysis":"【医疗急救语义场】`ambulance`（救护车）、`checkups`（检查）和 `treatment`（治疗）属于绝对封闭的医疗场景。救护车将急腹症患者送往的目的地必然是医院（hospital）。","hl":[]},{"no":50,"src":"2025·广东广州·中考真题","stem":"When the friendly dog Lucky walked onto the stage, he followed the leading actress perfectly. The entire ____50____ cheered with joy.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"passengers"},{"k":"B","v":"patients"},{"k":"C","v":"audience"},{"k":"D","v":"customers"}],"answer":"C","clue":"同场标志词群：“theatre, stage, actress, show”","analysis":"【剧场演出语义场】舞台（stage）、女主角（leading actress）和演出（show）属于剧场演出语义场。坐在台下观看并为演员欢呼喝彩的主体是观众（audience）。","hl":[]},{"no":51,"src":"2025·江苏无锡·中考真题","stem":"The hour-long bus journey had only just begun. The young man was sitting alone near the front window of the ____51____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"bus"},{"k":"B","v":"plane"},{"k":"C","v":"ship"},{"k":"D","v":"train"}],"answer":"A","clue":"同场标志词群：“bus journey, passengers, bus”","analysis":"【公共交通出行语义场】文章首句交代背景是公共汽车行程（bus journey），年轻男子独自就座的交通工具自然就是这辆大巴车（bus）。","hl":["bus journey"]},{"no":52,"src":"2025·四川乐山·中考真题","stem":"Wang Haoze successfully passed all the training tests and was finally selected as an astronaut to travel to outer ____52____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"space"},{"k":"B","v":"island"},{"k":"C","v":"ground"},{"k":"D","v":"mountain"}],"answer":"A","clue":"同场标志词群：“rocket engineer, astronaut, Shenzhou-19”","analysis":"【载人航天语义场】火箭工程师（rocket engineer）、宇航员（astronaut）以及神舟十九号飞船构建了庄严的航天语义场。航天员飞往的目的地必然是太空（space）。","hl":[]},{"no":53,"src":"2025·吉林长春·中考真题","stem":"Xu Dawei opened a community library in 2010. The library houses thousands of books on neatly arranged ____53____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"tables"},{"k":"B","v":"shelves"},{"k":"C","v":"beds"},{"k":"D","v":"boxes"}],"answer":"B","clue":"同场标志词群：“library, books, reading”","analysis":"【图书馆阅览语义场】图书馆（library）存放并整齐陈列成千上万册图书的专用设施，必然是书架（shelves）。","hl":[]},{"no":54,"src":"2025·山东菏泽·中考真题","stem":"I noticed that the kitchen was empty. The fridge had no milk and the shelves were completely out of ____54____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"food"},{"k":"B","v":"books"},{"k":"C","v":"clothes"},{"k":"D","v":"toys"}],"answer":"A","clue":"同场标志词群：“kitchen, fridge, milk, lunch”","analysis":"【厨房与食物储备语义场】厨房（kitchen）、冰箱（fridge）和牛奶（milk）同属于饮食储备语义场。空荡荡的冰箱和架子上缺乏的物品是食物（food）。","hl":[]},{"no":55,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"There was a reading competition in the local library. The proud ____55____ received new storybooks as prizes.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"teachers"},{"k":"B","v":"actors"},{"k":"C","v":"patients"},{"k":"D","v":"winners"}],"answer":"D","clue":"同场标志词群：“competition, prizes, received”","analysis":"【竞赛与颁奖语义场】比赛（competition）中能够领取奖品（prizes）的主体人群，必定是竞赛获胜者（winners）。","hl":[]},{"no":56,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"Swimming is popular in warm summer weather, but skiing down snowy mountains is widely enjoyed in ____56____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"spring"},{"k":"B","v":"autumn"},{"k":"C","v":"winter"},{"k":"D","v":"summer"}],"answer":"C","clue":"同场标志词群：“skiing, snowy mountains”与夏季游泳对比","analysis":"【季节与户外运动语义场】滑雪（skiing）和积雪覆盖的高山属于典型的冬季运动语义场。夏天游泳对比冬天滑雪（winter）。","hl":["snowy mountains"]},{"no":57,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"After graduating from medical university, he started working as a young ____57____ in the municipal hospital.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"guide"},{"k":"B","v":"doctor"},{"k":"C","v":"teacher"},{"k":"D","v":"waiter"}],"answer":"B","clue":"同场标志词群：“medical university, hospital”","analysis":"【医疗职业语义场】从医科大学（medical university）毕业并在综合医院（hospital）从事救死扶伤工作的专业人员是医生（doctor）。","hl":["medical university"]},{"no":58,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"They wanted to have dinner together, so they booked a table at a famous French ____58____ downtown.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"museum"},{"k":"B","v":"restaurant"},{"k":"C","v":"station"},{"k":"D","v":"library"}],"answer":"B","clue":"同场标志词群：“have dinner, booked a table”","analysis":"【餐饮服务语义场】共进晚餐（have dinner）和提前订桌（booked a table）是去餐馆/饭店（restaurant）就餐的典型场景动作。","hl":["booked a table"]},{"no":59,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"They went to the nearby ____59____ to buy some stamps and put them on envelopes before sending the letters.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"shop"},{"k":"B","v":"school"},{"k":"C","v":"village"},{"k":"D","v":"post office"}],"answer":"D","clue":"同场标志词群：“stamps, envelopes, sending letters”","analysis":"【邮政通信语义场】买邮票（stamps）、贴信封（envelopes）和寄信（sending letters）属于邮局（post office）的专属业务语义场。","hl":[]},{"no":60,"src":"2025·辽宁·中考真题","stem":"They drove to the seashore for a family picnic. Dad and Jack put up the tent on the golden ____60____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"sand"},{"k":"B","v":"floor"},{"k":"C","v":"roof"},{"k":"D","v":"bridge"}],"answer":"A","clue":"同场标志词群：“seashore, picnic, tent, beach”","analysis":"【海滩休闲语义场】海滨（seashore）与沙滩野餐搭建帐篷，脚下的天然地貌特征是金黄色的沙滩（sand）。","hl":[]}]},"ch2#0":{"mech":"2.1","name":"褒贬态度一致性","qs":[{"no":61,"src":"2025·江苏南通·中考真题","stem":"So when Aunt Jen invited us to her spring farm party, I was really ____61____. I had never experienced farm life before and couldn't wait to go.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"bored"},{"k":"B","v":"excited"},{"k":"C","v":"frightened"},{"k":"D","v":"tired"}],"answer":"B","clue":"后句迫不及待的积极期待：“couldn't wait to go (+)”","analysis":"【褒贬态度一致性】受邀参加向往已久的春季农场派对，且下文表达“迫不及待想去”，语境充满极度积极的期待感（+）。选项中 bored（无聊-）、frightened（害怕-）、tired（疲倦-）全为负面情绪，唯一正向极性词为 excited（兴奋激动的+）。","hl":["couldn't wait to go"]},{"no":62,"src":"2025·江苏常州·中考真题","stem":"A group of loud classmates jogged behind Emma, laughing suddenly and making cruel comments. Their rude words made Emma feel very ____62____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"impatient"},{"k":"B","v":"relaxed"},{"k":"C","v":"guilty"},{"k":"D","v":"uncomfortable"}],"answer":"D","clue":"前句恶意嘲笑行为：“laughing suddenly and making cruel comments (-)”","analysis":"【褒贬态度一致性】遭遇同学校园取笑与恶意评论，客观刺激事件性质极端负面（-）。主人公由此产生的心理状态必定是难过压抑与“极度不适的（uncomfortable，-）”。relaxed（放松+）色彩相反直接排除。","hl":["laughing suddenly and making cruel comments"]},{"no":63,"src":"2025·江苏宿迁·中考真题","stem":"Amy sang to the seed and watered it carefully. But after four days, only bare soil greeted her. Seeing no green shoots at all, she felt a little ____63____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"warm"},{"k":"B","v":"lazy"},{"k":"C","v":"glad"},{"k":"D","v":"sad"}],"answer":"D","clue":"前句未达预期事实：“only bare soil greeted her (-)”","analysis":"【褒贬态度一致性】满怀期待精心照料四天，土壤却依然光秃秃毫无生机，付出努力未能得到及时反馈，人物内心自然产生失落感（-）。选项中 warm（温暖+）、glad（高兴+）色彩反向，sad（沮丧难过的-）精准契合。","hl":["only bare soil greeted her"]},{"no":64,"src":"2025·四川广元·中考真题","stem":"After all kinds of urgent tests, the doctor said it was just mild appendicitis. We felt greatly ____64____ to know that Sam was finally out of danger.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"surprised"},{"k":"B","v":"relaxed"},{"k":"C","v":"disappointed"},{"k":"D","v":"worried"}],"answer":"B","clue":"后句脱离危险的喜讯：“Sam was finally out of danger (+)”","analysis":"【褒贬态度一致性】得知生病的朋友确无大碍、脱离危险，悬着的心终于落地，情绪由紧张焦虑彻底转为“如释重负的/放松的（relaxed，+）”。disappointed（失望-）与 worried（担忧-）色彩完全背离。","hl":["Sam was finally out of danger"]},{"no":65,"src":"2025·山东枣庄·中考真题","stem":"I got the worst score in the final exam that I had ever had. It felt like everyone was laughing at me. I felt so ____65____ that I completely lost hope.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"sad"},{"k":"B","v":"lucky"},{"k":"C","v":"happy"},{"k":"D","v":"bored"}],"answer":"A","clue":"前句遭遇考试滑铁卢与后句失去希望：“lost hope (-)”","analysis":"【褒贬态度一致性】考试全班垫底，且感觉同学都在嘲笑自己，后句更是直接说明“彻底失去了希望”，属于典型的人生低谷负向极性（-）。sad（悲伤痛苦的）符合逻辑，lucky（幸运+）与 happy（开心+）反向。","hl":["lost hope"]},{"no":66,"src":"2025·四川乐山·中考真题","stem":"Mark loved the guitar, but he felt ____66____ because he wasn’t getting any better despite long hours of practice.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"happy"},{"k":"B","v":"sad"},{"k":"C","v":"cool"},{"k":"D","v":"proud"}],"answer":"B","clue":"从句交代受挫原因：“wasn't getting any better (-)”","analysis":"【褒贬态度一致性】苦练吉他却毫无长进，琴技陷入停滞瓶颈，挫败感导致的自然是消极悲伤情绪（-）。sad（难过的）符合因果链，happy（高兴+）和 proud（自豪+）在逻辑上讲不通。","hl":["getting any better"]},{"no":67,"src":"2025·江苏徐州·中考真题","stem":"Parents both had high fevers and couldn’t take us out. “It’s going to be a ____67____ day with no fun plans!” Peter sighed and lowered his head.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"boring"},{"k":"B","v":"exciting"},{"k":"C","v":"relaxing"},{"k":"D","v":"colorful"}],"answer":"A","clue":"后文叹气动作与无趣现实：“with no fun plans, lowered his head (-)”","analysis":"【褒贬态度一致性】原本期待的周末动物园之旅泡汤，只能整天窝在家里且毫无趣味计划，彼得低头叹气，对其定性必然是“无聊乏味的（boring，-）”。exciting（令人兴奋的+）完全相反。","hl":["with no fun plans"]},{"no":68,"src":"2025·甘肃兰州·中考真题","stem":"Bob was a shy boy who always lowered his head. When he saw the warm smile and look of joy on the girl's face, he felt encouraged and gave a ____68____ reply.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"polite"},{"k":"B","v":"rude"},{"k":"C","v":"cold"},{"k":"D","v":"terrible"}],"answer":"A","clue":"前句温暖的笑容鼓舞：“warm smile, felt encouraged (+)”","analysis":"【褒贬态度一致性】在小顾客真诚亲切的笑容感染下，害羞的男孩鼓起勇气，其回应的语气态度必然是正向友好的（+）。polite（礼貌客气的+）符合情境，rude（粗鲁-）与 cold（冷酷-）背离氛围。","hl":["warm smile"]},{"no":69,"src":"2025·北京·中考真题","stem":"We spent wonderful hours baking the apple cake together. The house was filled with the sweet smell of apples and warm ____69____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"cold"},{"k":"B","v":"laughter"},{"k":"C","v":"noise"},{"k":"D","v":"darkness"}],"answer":"B","clue":"前文温馨祖孙合作烘焙语境：“wonderful hours, sweet smell (+)”","analysis":"【褒贬态度一致性】全篇描写祖孙两代人通过烘焙苹果派拉近距离的温情过程，温馨幸福的正向场景中，屋子里洋溢着苹果的芳香与欢快的“欢声笑语（laughter，+）”。","hl":["wonderful hours"]},{"no":70,"src":"2025·山东泰安·中考真题","stem":"It’s a wonderful project. Giving someone a sense of belonging brings great joy. It is always a good ____70____ to help someone out.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"feeling"},{"k":"B","v":"danger"},{"k":"C","v":"mistake"},{"k":"D","v":"trouble"}],"answer":"A","clue":"前句给他人带去温暖与快乐：“brings great joy (+)”","analysis":"【褒贬态度一致性】助人为乐给人带来的是内心的充实与快乐（+），用 a good feeling（美妙的感受）作主语补足语，danger（危险-）与 trouble（麻烦-）感情极性完全相反。","hl":["brings great joy"]},{"no":71,"src":"2025·湖北武汉·中考真题","stem":"In the morning, the weather was sunny and the birds were singing merrily. We set out along the valley in high spirits and felt very ____71____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"cheerful"},{"k":"B","v":"tired"},{"k":"C","v":"worried"},{"k":"D","v":"anxious"}],"answer":"A","clue":"清晨鸟鸣阳光普照好天气：“sunny, birds singing merrily (+)”","analysis":"【褒贬态度一致性】出发时阳光明媚、鸟儿欢唱，一家人兴高采烈（in high spirits），伴随的心情必定是极其“欢快愉悦的（cheerful，+）”。tired、worried、anxious 均为消极负面词。","hl":["singing merrily"]},{"no":72,"src":"2025·青海·中考真题","stem":"Every family member loved every dish he cooked. Seeing their happy faces, Mr. Li felt quite ____72____ of his culinary skills.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"ashamed"},{"k":"B","v":"proud"},{"k":"C","v":"afraid"},{"k":"D","v":"nervous"}],"answer":"B","clue":"家人对其厨艺交口称赞：“loved every dish he cooked (+)”","analysis":"【褒贬态度一致性】全家人对李老师做的每一道菜赞不绝口，看着家人的笑脸，李老师对自己的厨艺感到非常“自豪（proud，+）”。ashamed（羞愧的-）极性相反。","hl":["loved every dish he cooked"]},{"no":73,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"Beaches, blue sky and warm sunshine are great choices for tourists. Thailand is a wonderful place to try lots of ____73____ tropical fruits.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"terrible"},{"k":"B","v":"sour"},{"k":"C","v":"delicious"},{"k":"D","v":"awful"}],"answer":"C","clue":"旅游胜地积极推荐语境：“wonderful place (+)”","analysis":"【褒贬态度一致性】阳光沙滩的度假胜地背景下，极力推荐给游客品尝的热带水果必然是正向赞赏的“美味的（delicious，+）”。terrible（糟糕的-）和 awful（可怕的-）色彩相反。","hl":["wonderful place"]},{"no":74,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"Miss Chan is the most thoughtful and caring teacher we have ever met. She always thinks of our feelings and all the students feel very ____74____ to be in her class.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"unlucky"},{"k":"B","v":"lucky"},{"k":"C","v":"bored"},{"k":"D","v":"angry"}],"answer":"B","clue":"老师体贴关怀：“most thoughtful and caring (+)”","analysis":"【褒贬态度一致性】面对最具爱心与责任感的好老师，成为她的学生自然让人感到极其“幸运（lucky，+）”。unlucky、bored、angry 全为负面消极词。","hl":["most thoughtful and caring"]},{"no":75,"src":"2025·四川凉山·中考真题","stem":"You will be amazed by Lugu Lake's natural beauty and the warm welcome from the local people. It is a(n) ____75____ place to experience a unique lifestyle.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"wonderful"},{"k":"B","v":"terrible"},{"k":"C","v":"awful"},{"k":"D","v":"noisy"}],"answer":"A","clue":"美景与热烈欢迎：“amazed by natural beauty, warm welcome (+)”","analysis":"【褒贬态度一致性】被大自然的美丽震撼并受到当地人热烈欢迎，作者对泸沽湖的评价必定是高度正向赞赏的“绝妙的/令人赞叹的（wonderful，+）”。","hl":["natural beauty"]}]},"ch2#1":{"mech":"2.2","name":"情感转折与突变","qs":[{"no":76,"src":"2025·江苏徐州·中考真题","stem":"Last Sunday was sunny and the Browns were looking forward to the zoo trip. ____76____, Mom and Dad both had high fevers and everyone had to stay inside.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"Happily"},{"k":"B","v":"Usually"},{"k":"C","v":"Unluckily"},{"k":"D","v":"Hopefully"}],"answer":"C","clue":"美好期待遇突发感冒变故：“looking forward to (+) ↔ fevers, stay inside (-)”","analysis":"【情感突变规律】前半段全家欢欣雀跃期待游玩（+），转折后父母双双突发高烧、计划彻底搁浅（-）。情感曲线由正向直接跌入谷底，副词必定是表示不幸变故的 Unluckily（不幸的是）。","hl":["looking forward to"]},{"no":77,"src":"2025·湖北武汉·中考真题","stem":"Birds were singing along the way while we enjoyed the warm sunshine. But storm clouds came unexpectedly, putting us in great ____77____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"peace"},{"k":"B","v":"joy"},{"k":"C","v":"trouble"},{"k":"D","v":"safety"}],"answer":"C","clue":"转折词 But 标志晴天转暴雨：“sunny (+) ↔ storm clouds, trouble (-)”","analysis":"【情感突变规律】转折连词 But 是强烈的变轨信号！前句是鸟鸣阳光的美好时光（+），But 之后狂风暴雨突降，处境瞬间逆转为陷入险境（in great trouble，-）。","hl":["storm clouds"]},{"no":78,"src":"2025·辽宁·中考真题","stem":"Dad promised we would have a big feast on the way home, which made everyone happy. But later they found that the only restaurant was closed. Mum and Dad became ____78____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"sad"},{"k":"B","v":"excited"},{"k":"C","v":"glad"},{"k":"D","v":"proud"}],"answer":"A","clue":"承诺大餐开心转关门落空：“happy (+) ↔ closed, sad (-)”","analysis":"【情感突变规律】转折连词 But 之前是期待美味大餐的兴奋心情（+），But 之后残酷的事实是唯一的餐馆关门歇业，期待落空后父母的心情必然由喜转悲（sad，-）。","hl":[]},{"no":79,"src":"2025·四川广元·中考真题","stem":"We hoped that a glass of warm water would reduce his pain. But things went against our wishes and Sam’s condition became much ____79____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"better"},{"k":"B","v":"worse"},{"k":"C","v":"safer"},{"k":"D","v":"easier"}],"answer":"B","clue":"事与愿违信号词：“went against our wishes (-)”","analysis":"【情感突变规律】`went against our wishes`（事与愿违）是强烈的负向转折信号！病情不但没有缓解，反而急转直下由坏变糟（developed from bad to worse）。","hl":["went against our wishes"]},{"no":80,"src":"2025·广东广州·中考真题","stem":"The audition was going badly and Mr. Lee was getting really worried. Just then, a friend brought us his dog Lucky, which gave everyone new ____80____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"trouble"},{"k":"B","v":"fear"},{"k":"C","v":"hope"},{"k":"D","v":"anger"}],"answer":"C","clue":"变故信号词 Just then 带来转机：“worried (-) ↔ new hope (+)”","analysis":"【情感突变规律】戏剧导演原本因选不到合适的小狗演员而焦虑万分（-），突发转机词 `Just then`（正在那时）引入救星三脚犬 Lucky，将绝望的心情瞬间拉回充满希望（hope，+）。","hl":[]},{"no":81,"src":"2025·山东枣庄·中考真题","stem":"I was crying over my terrible exam score and lost all hope. Suddenly, I found a warm letter from my parents on my desk, which ____81____ me up.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"gave"},{"k":"B","v":"cheered"},{"k":"C","v":"locked"},{"k":"D","v":"slowed"}],"answer":"B","clue":"副词 Suddenly 逆转绝望：“lost all hope (-) ↔ cheered me up (+)”","analysis":"【情感突变规律】副词 Suddenly 标志着转机的突然降临！前文作者沉浸在考试失败的痛苦中（-），父母温暖的来信如阳光照入，让作者瞬间振作起来（cheered me up，+）。","hl":["lost all hope"]},{"no":82,"src":"2025·四川乐山·中考真题","stem":"Mark was very tired and wanted to give up climbing the high hill. But his father encouraged him with a gentle smile, and Mark became ____82____ again.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"brave"},{"k":"B","v":"lazy"},{"k":"C","v":"scared"},{"k":"D","v":"hopeless"}],"answer":"A","clue":"转折词 But 伴随父亲鼓励：“give up (-) ↔ brave (+)”","analysis":"【情感突变规律】疲惫想放弃是退缩的负面状态（-），转折连词 But 之后伴随着父亲的微笑鼓励，马克驱散怯懦，重新变得勇敢顽强（brave，+）。","hl":[]},{"no":83,"src":"2025·江苏宿迁·中考真题","stem":"The soil had turned into a muddy mess. ____83____, a heavy rain poured down that weekend, making the poor seeds drown in water.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"Luckily"},{"k":"B","v":"Patiently"},{"k":"C","v":"Unluckily"},{"k":"D","v":"Happily"}],"answer":"C","clue":"雪上加霜事实：“muddy mess ↔ heavy rain poured down (-)”","analysis":"【情感突变规律】土壤本已过度积水变成泥泞，偏偏那个周末又下了一场倾盆大雨，雪上加霜的不幸事件，必须使用负面副词 Unluckily（不幸的是）。","hl":["heavy rain poured down"]},{"no":84,"src":"2025·山东泰安·中考真题","stem":"Some kids used to sit alone in the corner with nobody to talk to. But since they joined Kellen’s project, they have become lively and ____84____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"outgoing"},{"k":"B","v":"silent"},{"k":"C","v":"lonely"},{"k":"D","v":"afraid"}],"answer":"A","clue":"转折词 But 改变孤僻状态：“sit alone, nobody (-) ↔ lively, outgoing (+)”","analysis":"【情感突变规律】过去孤单沉默无朋友（-），转折词 But 之后迎来巨大改变，变得活泼开朗（lively and outgoing，+）。并列连词 and 连接同向正极词汇。","hl":["sit alone"]},{"no":85,"src":"2025·四川资阳·中考真题","stem":"I always felt terribly self-conscious about the birthmark on my face and tried hard to cover it. But Maddie smiled and said it looked unique, which made me feel ____85____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"painful"},{"k":"B","v":"confident"},{"k":"C","v":"worried"},{"k":"D","v":"ashamed"}],"answer":"B","clue":"朋友真诚夸赞逆转自卑心理：“cover it (-) ↔ unique, confident (+)”","analysis":"【情感突变规律】前半段长期因胎记自卑躲闪（-），转折词 But 之后朋友赞叹其独特美丽，解开心结后的心理状态立刻逆转为自信阳光（confident，+）。","hl":[]},{"no":86,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"Sometimes, Pi felt very happy and hopeful about being rescued. But at other times, he felt lonely and terribly ____86____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"excited"},{"k":"B","v":"proud"},{"k":"C","v":"afraid"},{"k":"D","v":"relaxed"}],"answer":"C","clue":"对照转折：“happy and hopeful (+) ↔ lonely and afraid (-)”","analysis":"【情感突变规律】对称转折结构：前句是 happy and hopeful（开心且充满希望+），转折词 But 之后对应的是孤单与恐惧（lonely and afraid-）。","hl":["happy and hopeful"]},{"no":87,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"They lived a very happy life years ago. Unfortunately, the father lost his job and they became quite ____87____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"poor"},{"k":"B","v":"wealthy"},{"k":"C","v":"famous"},{"k":"D","v":"safe"}],"answer":"A","clue":"副词 Unfortunately 强转折：“happy life (+) ↔ lost his job, poor (-)”","analysis":"【情感突变规律】由不幸信号词 Unfortunately 引出家庭变故，失业后家庭经济状况由富裕优渥直接逆转为贫穷困顿（poor，-）。","hl":["lost his job"]},{"no":88,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"After school, he played football hard for two hours and was exhausted. Though very ____88____, he still hurried to the hospital to visit his sick grandma.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"excited"},{"k":"B","v":"tired"},{"k":"C","v":"happy"},{"k":"D","v":"fresh"}],"answer":"B","clue":"让步连词 Though 承认疲惫身体状态：“played football hard, exhausted (-)”","analysis":"【情感与状态转折】前文交代踢球两个小时筋疲力尽（exhausted），让步状语从句 Though 承认其客观身体状态极其“疲倦劳累（tired，-）”，主句突出其孝心。","hl":["played football hard"]},{"no":89,"src":"2025·北京·中考真题","stem":"Grandpa fell ill and had to stay in the hospital, which made the holiday gloomy. However, baking his cake brought our family ____89____ again.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"warmth"},{"k":"B","v":"anger"},{"k":"C","v":"sorrow"},{"k":"D","v":"coldness"}],"answer":"A","clue":"转折词 However 驱散阴霾：“gloomy (-) ↔ warmth (+)”","analysis":"【情感突变规律】外公生病住院让节日气氛蒙上阴影（-），转折词 However 之后，烘焙外公招牌苹果派的传统让全家重温温情，带来了家庭温暖（warmth，+）。","hl":[]},{"no":90,"src":"2025·江苏南通·中考真题","stem":"Our car broke down on the country road and we never made it to the farm party. But sitting in the field watching wild birds filled me with ____90____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"sadness"},{"k":"B","v":"wonder"},{"k":"C","v":"regret"},{"k":"D","v":"pain"}],"answer":"B","clue":"转折词 But 发现意外之美：“never made it (-) ↔ unexpected wonders (+)”","analysis":"【情感突变规律】虽然没能按计划抵达派对（-），但转折词 But 之后在野外意外邂逅百万候鸟迁徙的壮丽奇景，内心充满了惊叹与奇迹之感（wonder，+）。","hl":["never made it"]}]},"ch2#2":{"mech":"2.3","name":"标点符号与语气强化","qs":[{"no":91,"src":"2025·江苏南通·中考真题","stem":"Millions of birds flew across the golden sunset like a moving cloud. “Wow!” I cried out in surprise. “It’s like pure ____91____!”","options":[{"k":"A","v":"wind"},{"k":"B","v":"magic"},{"k":"C","v":"dust"},{"k":"D","v":"smoke"}],"answer":"B","clue":"感叹词 Wow! 与双感叹号强烈语气：“‘Wow!’ I cried... ‘It’s like ____!’”","analysis":"【标点符号与语气强化】感叹词 Wow! 与感叹号 ! 标志着主人公极度的惊艳与震撼。能与如此宏大奇观与强烈语气匹配的，只有如同神圣“魔法般不可思议（magic！）”的体验。","hl":["Wow!” I cried","It’s like"]},{"no":92,"src":"2025·江苏宿迁·中考真题","stem":"One morning, a green shoot pushed through the soil. Amy was too excited to speak. “Mr. Green, look at my plant! It has finally ____92____!”","options":[{"k":"A","v":"died"},{"k":"B","v":"sprouted"},{"k":"C","v":"broken"},{"k":"D","v":"stopped"}],"answer":"B","clue":"直接引语感叹号：“look at my plant! It has finally ____!”","analysis":"【标点符号与语气强化】艾米兴奋得说不出话，直接引语中连用两个感叹号强化喜悦心情。呼应前句绿芽钻出土壤的奇迹，感叹的必然是种子终于“发芽破土了（sprouted！）”。","hl":["look at my plant! It has finally"]},{"no":93,"src":"2025·甘肃兰州·中考真题","stem":"To her surprise, Bob’s mother found only three cups left on the table. “Good boy, what a ____93____ job you have done!” said his mother with a proud smile.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"terrible"},{"k":"B","v":"wonderful"},{"k":"C","v":"poor"},{"k":"D","v":"slow"}],"answer":"B","clue":"感叹句结构及感叹号：“what a ____ job you have done!”","analysis":"【标点符号·感叹句强化】what a...感叹句型搭配句末感叹号，伴随母亲自豪骄傲的微笑，语气必然是极度赞扬的褒义词。wonderful job（极出色的工作！）符合感叹句语气。","hl":["job you have done"]},{"no":94,"src":"2025·湖北武汉·中考真题","stem":"Dad pulled out an emergency blanket and dry cookies from his backpack. “Ta-da! Look! We are ____94____!” Dad cheered as the wind blew hard outside.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"saved"},{"k":"B","v":"trapped"},{"k":"C","v":"lost"},{"k":"D","v":"ruined"}],"answer":"A","clue":"感叹词 Ta-da! 与感叹号：“Ta-da! Look! We are ____!”","analysis":"【标点符号与语气强化】拟声感叹词 `Ta-da!`（当当当当！展示奇迹）搭配 `Look!` 和感叹号，爸爸在暴风雨中变出救生毯与食物，宣告的欢呼必然是我们“得救了/安全了（saved！）”。","hl":["Ta-da! Look! We are"]},{"no":95,"src":"2025·黑龙江大庆·中考真题","stem":"“Goodness!” Amy jumped up happily with a big shout. “I can make one dollar and sixty cents from picking strawberries! That's a huge ____95____ for me!”","options":[{"k":"A","v":"mistake"},{"k":"B","v":"fortune"},{"k":"C","v":"trouble"},{"k":"D","v":"danger"}],"answer":"B","clue":"感叹词 Goodness! 与感叹号：“Goodness! ... That’s a huge ____!”","analysis":"【标点符号与语气强化】感叹词 `Goodness!`（天哪！）与高兴跳跃的动作，直接引语感叹号强化了小女孩对赚到这笔钱的狂喜。对贫困小女孩而言，这是一笔巨大的财富（huge fortune！）。","hl":[]},{"no":96,"src":"2025·江苏无锡·中考真题","stem":"The aunt’s story was extremely boring. “Oh, it’s definitely the most ____96____ story I’ve ever heard!” said Cyril with deep disdain.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"interesting"},{"k":"B","v":"stupid"},{"k":"C","v":"exciting"},{"k":"D","v":"meaningful"}],"answer":"B","clue":"感叹号与讽刺语气：“the most ____ story I've ever heard!”","analysis":"【标点符号与极端贬义】前文提到姑姑的故事极其无聊，小男孩用感叹语气进行极端贬损评价：“这绝对是我听过最愚蠢无聊的故事（stupid！）”。","hl":["the most"]},{"no":97,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"I first went to hear a live rock concert when I was eight. When the famous singer ran onto the stage, I was really ____97____!","options":[{"k":"A","v":"relaxed"},{"k":"B","v":"embarrassed"},{"k":"C","v":"excited"},{"k":"D","v":"bored"}],"answer":"C","clue":"摇滚演唱会现场感叹号强化：“I was really ____!”","analysis":"【标点符号与情绪爆发】摇滚演唱会现场偶遇偶像登台，句末感叹号展现出八岁孩子无法自抑的心情激荡。选项中只有 excited（极度亢奋激动的！）能承受住感叹号的重音。","hl":["I was really"]},{"no":98,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"“Four more red lights!” the angry taxi driver shouted, pounding on the steering wheel. “It is so ____98____!”","options":[{"k":"A","v":"wonderful"},{"k":"B","v":"terrible"},{"k":"C","v":"pleasant"},{"k":"D","v":"lucky"}],"answer":"B","clue":"愤怒砸方向盘与直接引语感叹号：“‘It is so ____!’”","analysis":"【标点符号与负面发泄】连续遇到四个红灯，出租车司机愤怒砸方向盘咆哮，直接引语感叹号宣泄的是极度糟糕烦躁的负面情绪：It is so terrible!（太糟糕了！）。","hl":["It is so"]},{"no":99,"src":"2025·辽宁·中考真题","stem":"When they opened the front door, the lost basket of food was sitting there. “We can finally have our picnic now!” Jack shouted with great ____99____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"sadness"},{"k":"B","v":"joy"},{"k":"C","v":"anger"},{"k":"D","v":"fear"}],"answer":"B","clue":"感叹句大声呼喊：“have our picnic now!”与欢呼动作","analysis":"【标点符号与破案喜悦】历经波折回家后发现野餐篮完好无损，杰克带着感叹号大声欢呼，伴随的情感状态必然是巨大的喜悦（with great joy）。","hl":["have our picnic now"]},{"no":100,"src":"2025·四川广元·中考真题","stem":"The nest began to fall from the tree branch! “Watch out!” Mom shouted in a frightened voice. “Quickly catch the baby ____100____!”","options":[{"k":"A","v":"bird"},{"k":"B","v":"snake"},{"k":"C","v":"fish"},{"k":"D","v":"stone"}],"answer":"A","clue":"危急指令感叹号：“Watch out! ... catch the baby ____!”","analysis":"【标点符号与急迫动作】感叹号“小心！”提示危急关头，树上鸟巢坠落，急切喊出要接住的只能是幼鸟（baby bird！）。","hl":["Watch out","catch the baby"]},{"no":101,"src":"2025·江苏常州·中考真题","stem":"How could a new girl with a big facial scar be so brave and cheerful? “Why couldn't I act like her!” Emma questioned herself with a deep ____101____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"smile"},{"k":"B","v":"breath"},{"k":"C","v":"laugh"},{"k":"D","v":"sigh"}],"answer":"D","clue":"自愧不如的反问感叹句：“Why couldn't I act like her!”","analysis":"【标点符号与反思叹息】看到伤疤女孩如此自信，艾米自愧不如地反问质问自己，伴随的反思动作是深深的叹息（with a deep sigh）。","hl":["Why couldn't I act like her"]},{"no":102,"src":"2025·山东青岛·中考真题","stem":"“An inch of time is worth an inch of gold, but an inch of gold cannot buy an inch of time!” What a wise ____102____ this is!","options":[{"k":"A","v":"excuse"},{"k":"B","v":"saying"},{"k":"C","v":"joke"},{"k":"D","v":"lie"}],"answer":"B","clue":"引用千年古训与感叹句：“What a wise ____ this is!”","analysis":"【标点符号与警句感叹】“一寸光阴一寸金，寸金难买寸光阴”，句末感叹号高度评价该经典名句，其性质是富含智慧的“谚语/格言（wise saying！）”。","hl":["What a wise"]},{"no":103,"src":"2025·四川乐山·中考真题","stem":"Wang Haoze spent nearly 1,000 times practicing in the simulator. When the rocket lifted off, she cheered, “Motherland, here I ____103____!”","options":[{"k":"A","v":"come"},{"k":"B","v":"leave"},{"k":"C","v":"fall"},{"k":"D","v":"hide"}],"answer":"A","clue":"航天员飞天豪迈呼喊：“Motherland, here I ____!”","analysis":"【标点符号与豪迈宣誓】火箭腾空而起进入太空的高光时刻，感叹号承载着航天员报效祖国的崇高自豪：“祖国，我来了！（here I come！）”。","hl":["Motherland, here I"]},{"no":104,"src":"2025·四川资阳·中考真题","stem":"Always try your best, keep moving forward, and never be afraid to make changes when needed! Success is waiting for you in the ____104____!","options":[{"k":"A","v":"past"},{"k":"B","v":"future"},{"k":"C","v":"dark"},{"k":"D","v":"silence"}],"answer":"B","clue":"励志总结感叹号：“Success is waiting for you in the ____!”","analysis":"【标点符号与励志号召】文章末尾的连续感叹号是作者对读者的终极号召与鼓舞，成功必定在“未来（in the future！）”等待着每一个勇敢行动的人。","hl":["Success is waiting for you in the"]},{"no":105,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"The blind man smiled proudly. “Believe it or not, I have never knocked into anyone in the dark! My bright lantern protects ____105____!”","options":[{"k":"A","v":"them"},{"k":"B","v":"me"},{"k":"C","v":"us"},{"k":"D","v":"you"}],"answer":"B","clue":"盲人揭示真相的感叹句：“My bright lantern protects ____!”","analysis":"【标点符号与自信揭秘】盲人骄傲微笑并带着感叹号揭晓谜底：灯笼不是用来照路的，而是让别人看见自己，保护“我自己（protects me！）”。","hl":["My bright lantern protects"]}]},"ch2#3":{"mech":"2.4","name":"情绪梯级辨析","qs":[{"no":106,"src":"2025·北京·中考真题","stem":"When I first found out that my quiet grandfather was actually the master chef behind the cake, I was not just surprised, but greatly ____106____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"calm"},{"k":"B","v":"amazed"},{"k":"C","v":"bored"},{"k":"D","v":"sleepy"}],"answer":"B","clue":"从一般惊讶递进至极度震撼：“not just surprised, but greatly ____”","analysis":"【情绪梯级递进】句式使用 not just... but greatly... 构建了清晰的情绪递进阶梯。从普通的好奇惊讶（surprised）升华到无以复加的“极度惊叹与钦佩（amazed）”。","hl":["not just surprised, but greatly"]},{"no":107,"src":"2025·江苏南通·中考真题","stem":"When things don’t work out as planned, small daily disappointments may actually lead to ____107____ wonders if you keep your eyes open.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"ordinary"},{"k":"B","v":"unexpected"},{"k":"C","v":"simple"},{"k":"D","v":"tiny"}],"answer":"B","clue":"平淡琐事与震撼自然奇观对比：“disappointments ↔ unexpected wonders”","analysis":"【情绪梯级与词义量级】文章末尾升华主旨，日常的“小失望（small disappointments）”与偶遇百万候鸟迁徙的“意外震撼奇迹（unexpected wonders）”形成鲜明的人生感悟量级对照。","hl":[]},{"no":108,"src":"2025·山东泰安·中考真题","stem":"Seeing those once silent kids now happily running around the playground, Kellen felt not only pleased, but deeply ____108____ of what his project achieved.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"ashamed"},{"k":"B","v":"tired"},{"k":"C","v":"proud"},{"k":"D","v":"afraid"}],"answer":"C","clue":"从普通高兴递进至崇高自豪：“not only pleased, but deeply ____”","analysis":"【情绪梯级递进】普通的高兴是 pleased，但看到自己的公益项目真正改变了孤僻同学的校园生活，九岁男孩内心升腾起的是更高精神层面的“崇高自豪感（proud）”。","hl":["not only pleased, but deeply"]},{"no":109,"src":"2025·四川广元·中考真题","stem":"Hearing Sam groan louder and louder in the midnight, we became very worried, and soon grew quite ____109____ about his life.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"glad"},{"k":"B","v":"panicked"},{"k":"C","v":"curious"},{"k":"D","v":"relaxed"}],"answer":"B","clue":"深夜呻吟加剧，担忧升级为恐慌：“grew quite panicked about his life”","analysis":"【情绪梯级递进】从最初的担心（worried）升级到深夜剧痛呻吟、呼叫救护车的危急关头，心理焦虑梯级飙升至“恐慌慌乱（panicked）”。","hl":["about his life"]},{"no":110,"src":"2025·江苏常州·中考真题","stem":"The rude comments from her classmates did not just make Emma sad; they made her feel completely ____110____ about herself.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"helpless"},{"k":"B","v":"proud"},{"k":"C","v":"hopeful"},{"k":"D","v":"cheerful"}],"answer":"A","clue":"自卑心理恶化：“not just sad; made her feel completely ____”","analysis":"【情绪梯级递进】恶意的身体羞辱带给内向女生的不仅仅是短暂伤心（sad），而是发展到每逢体育课就低头缩紧、感到深入骨髓的“无助绝望（helpless）”。","hl":["made her feel completely"]},{"no":111,"src":"2025·湖北武汉·中考真题","stem":"When storm clouds turned the forest black and rain poured like waterfalls, I was no longer just unhappy, but deeply ____111____ of getting lost.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"terrified"},{"k":"B","v":"comfortable"},{"k":"C","v":"glad"},{"k":"D","v":"bored"}],"answer":"A","clue":"黑云压顶暴雨倾盆：“no longer just unhappy, but deeply ____”","analysis":"【情绪梯级递进】起初只是因生日泡汤感到不悦（unhappy），当森林彻底变黑、暴雨倾盆迷失方向时，情绪梯级升级为对大自然未知的“极度恐惧（terrified）”。","hl":["no longer just unhappy, but deeply"]},{"no":112,"src":"2025·四川乐山·中考真题","stem":"After nearly 1,000 times of challenging training, Wang Haoze didn’t just meet the standards, but became the most ____112____ female astronaut.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"outstanding"},{"k":"B","v":"lazy"},{"k":"C","v":"common"},{"k":"D","v":"weak"}],"answer":"A","clue":"打破千次极限训练的高阶赞赏：“became the most ____”","analysis":"【情绪与评价梯级】在万选一的残酷淘汰中完成近千次训练并顺利飞天，用最高级的赞誉修饰中国航天英雄，只能是出类拔萃的“杰出优秀的（outstanding）”。","hl":["became the most"]},{"no":113,"src":"2025·山东青岛·中考真题","stem":"Understanding old idioms is not only useful for daily communication, but ____114____ for building deep cultural connections.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"essential"},{"k":"B","v":"useless"},{"k":"C","v":"harmful"},{"k":"D","v":"bad"}],"answer":"A","clue":"从一般有用升华至核心本质：“not only useful, but ____”","analysis":"【梯级递进关系】not only... but... 构成概念价值递进：理解成语不仅在日常交际中“有用（useful）”，对于跨文化深度理解更是“必不可少的/本质核心的（essential）”。","hl":["not only useful"]},{"no":114,"src":"2025·吉林长春·中考真题","stem":"Running a free library is hard work, but for Xu Dawei, it is the most ____114____ thing he has ever done for society.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"meaningful"},{"k":"B","v":"painful"},{"k":"C","v":"harmful"},{"k":"D","v":"dangerous"}],"answer":"A","clue":"从个人劳苦升华到崇高社会价值：“the most ____ thing for society”","analysis":"【价值梯级升华】虽然自费办馆困难重重，但在社会精神财富传承层面，徐大伟将其视为毕生最具有“深远意义的（meaningful）”崇高事业。","hl":["the most"]},{"no":115,"src":"2025·山东菏泽·中考真题","stem":"Aunt Charlotte’s silent kindness was not just helpful; she was being a truly ____115____ example of how to love others.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"shining"},{"k":"B","v":"dark"},{"k":"C","v":"poor"},{"k":"D","v":"quiet"}],"answer":"A","clue":"从普通帮助升华至人生精神楷模：“shining example”","analysis":"【修辞与评价梯级】阿姨无私将派送给贫困家庭的善举，在作者五十年的人生中不是普通的资助，而是树立了一座指引人生的“闪闪发光的（shining）”精神榜样。","hl":[]},{"no":116,"src":"2025·辽宁·中考真题","stem":"A series of small accidents ruined the picnic, but Jack’s funny jokes kept everyone from becoming deeply ____116____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"depressed"},{"k":"B","v":"excited"},{"k":"C","v":"cheerful"},{"k":"D","v":"calm"}],"answer":"A","clue":"阻止全家情绪从失落滑向重度沮丧：“from becoming deeply ____”","analysis":"【情绪梯级防范】蛋糕摔坏、餐馆关门，全家心情原本可能滑向“极度沮丧消沉（deeply depressed）”，杰克的幽默玩笑化解了这种沉重负面情绪。","hl":["from becoming deeply"]},{"no":117,"src":"2025·四川资阳·中考真题","stem":"Maddie’s genuine praise made my heart melt. I realized that my strawberry birthmark was not a shame, but something very ____117____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"special"},{"k":"B","v":"terrible"},{"k":"C","v":"useless"},{"k":"D","v":"harmful"}],"answer":"A","clue":"从羞耻丑陋升华至独特特别：“not a shame, but something very ____”","analysis":"【认知梯级重塑】从视为丑陋耻辱（shame），到彻底领悟每个人都有独一无二之处，红胎记在作者心中升华为“无比独特特别的（special）”生命印记。","hl":["not a shame, but something very"]},{"no":118,"src":"2025·甘肃兰州·中考真题","stem":"After talking with the customers, Bob didn’t just overcome his shyness; he discovered a ____118____ power of self-confidence.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"great"},{"k":"B","v":"tiny"},{"k":"C","v":"weak"},{"k":"D","v":"slow"}],"answer":"A","clue":"自信力量的高阶升华：“a ____ power of self-confidence”","analysis":"【力量量级升华】文章结尾议论文段升华主题，自信不仅仅是敢于说话，更是一种能激发出每个人无限潜能的“伟大的（great）”力量。","hl":["power of self-confidence"]},{"no":119,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"Hearing the thunderous applause from the thousands in the audience, the young violinist was ____119____ with tears in her eyes.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"thrilled"},{"k":"B","v":"sleepy"},{"k":"C","v":"tired"},{"k":"D","v":"angry"}],"answer":"A","clue":"全场雷鸣掌声下的热泪盈眶：“thunderous applause, tears in eyes”","analysis":"【情绪梯级最高级】在成千上万名观众雷鸣般的掌声中激动得热泪盈眶，这种极度的喜悦与成就感已经远超普通 happy，属于最高梯级的“狂喜震撼（thrilled）”。","hl":["thunderous applause"]},{"no":120,"src":"2025·山东潍坊·中考真题","stem":"Sitting in front of screens all day long poses not a minor inconvenience, but a ____120____ risk to long-term physical health.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"major"},{"k":"B","v":"funny"},{"k":"C","v":"comfortable"},{"k":"D","v":"sweet"}],"answer":"A","clue":"轻度不便升级为重大危险：“not a minor inconvenience, but a ____ risk”","analysis":"【程度梯级对立】前文的 minor（轻微的）与后文设空构成强烈的程度量级对比，久坐屏幕对健康的长期威胁是一个“重大的（major）”风险。","hl":["not a minor inconvenience, but a"]}]},"ch3#0":{"mech":"3.1","name":"句内修饰限制","qs":[{"no":121,"src":"2025·山东威海·中考真题","stem":"Woodpeckers have long, sharp beaks which they use to make holes in trees to find ____121____ insects hiding inside the wood.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"noisy"},{"k":"B","v":"tasty"},{"k":"C","v":"heavy"},{"k":"D","v":"dangerous"}],"answer":"B","clue":"句内关系代词从句与修饰限制：“insects hiding inside the wood（树内昆虫）”","analysis":"【句内修饰与限制语境】句中定语修饰语“树木深处被啄木鸟凿洞寻找的昆虫”，站在啄木鸟觅食捕食的立场，其修饰语必须是表达美味诱人的“可口的/美味的（tasty）”。","hl":["insects hiding inside the wood"]},{"no":122,"src":"2025·江苏南通·中考真题","stem":"I baked cupcakes for the party and decorated them to look like soft sheep with white candies to make them look ____122____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"fresh"},{"k":"B","v":"cute"},{"k":"C","v":"clear"},{"k":"D","v":"sweet"}],"answer":"B","clue":"句内状语修饰限制：“look like soft sheep（看起来像软绵绵的小羊）”","analysis":"【句内修饰限制】句内将纸杯蛋糕装饰成“毛茸茸的小羊”，视觉形象呈现出的是极富童趣的“可爱的（cute）”。fresh（新鲜）或 clear（清晰）均无法准确描摹外形特点。","hl":["look like soft sheep"]},{"no":123,"src":"2025·四川凉山·中考真题","stem":"If you visit their villages, you can join in the lively bonfire party at night, ____123____ and dancing together with Mosuo people.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"crying"},{"k":"B","v":"singing"},{"k":"C","v":"sleeping"},{"k":"D","v":"reading"}],"answer":"B","clue":"句内伴随分词短语：“join in the bonfire party at night... and dancing”","analysis":"【句内伴随与固定搭配】句内由 and 连接两个并列伴随现在分词：singing and dancing（载歌载舞），完美契合参加夜晚篝火晚会（bonfire party）的欢乐场景限制。","hl":["bonfire party at night","and dancing"]},{"no":124,"src":"2025·山东青岛·中考真题","stem":"Ancient sundials were made of a flat, ____124____ stone plate marked with time scales showing the sun’s daily movement.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"long"},{"k":"B","v":"round"},{"k":"C","v":"square"},{"k":"D","v":"deep"}],"answer":"B","clue":"句内后置修饰与日晷物理结构限制：“marked with time scales showing sun's daily movement”","analysis":"【句内功能限制】日晷盘面随着太阳从升起到落下的弧度投影角度变化，其刻度盘必须是扁平且“圆形的（round）”，这一形状限制被其计时物理原理牢牢锁死。","hl":["marked with time scales showing"]},{"no":125,"src":"2025·山东潍坊·中考真题","stem":"People who sit in front of computers for too long can easily get severe pain in their eyes, arms, necks, and ____125____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"shoes"},{"k":"B","v":"backs"},{"k":"C","v":"clothes"},{"k":"D","v":"chairs"}],"answer":"B","clue":"句内并列身体器官群：“eyes, arms, necks, and ____”","analysis":"【句内并列成分限制】句内是由 and 连接的一串久坐伏案受损的身体解剖器官名称：眼睛、手臂、颈椎和“背部（backs）”。椅子、鞋子完全属于语法与语义越界。","hl":["eyes, arms, necks, and"]},{"no":126,"src":"2025·吉林长春·中考真题","stem":"Sitting in a small hutong in Beijing, the special library is only seven square meters, making it perhaps the ____126____ library in the world.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"strongest"},{"k":"B","v":"smallest"},{"k":"C","v":"oldest"},{"k":"D","v":"safest"}],"answer":"B","clue":"句内同句物理数据限制：“only seven square meters（仅有七平方米）”","analysis":"【句内数据硬约束】句中前文给出了极具刚性的客观数字限制——“仅仅七平方米（seven square meters）”。在如此狭小的空间约束下，它必然是世界上“最小的（smallest）”图书馆。","hl":["only seven square meters"]},{"no":127,"src":"2025·山西·中考真题","stem":"A man couldn't stand up for two years. Beinao-1 sends small electrical signals to his ____127____ to help him take small steps.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"ears"},{"k":"B","v":"legs"},{"k":"C","v":"hands"},{"k":"D","v":"teeth"}],"answer":"B","clue":"句内目的不定式短语：“to help him take small steps（迈出碎步）”","analysis":"【句内生理动作限制】动作结果是帮助瘫痪男子“迈出步子（take small steps）”，负责行走迈步的受体器官只能是“腿部（legs）”。","hl":["to help him take small steps"]},{"no":128,"src":"2025·江苏常州·中考真题","stem":"She had bright, clear eyes and a long scar running across the left side of her ____128____ from an old bike accident.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"leg"},{"k":"B","v":"face"},{"k":"C","v":"hand"},{"k":"D","v":"back"}],"answer":"B","clue":"句内并列主语与解剖位置：“bright, clear eyes and a long scar”","analysis":"【句内解剖位置限制】与明亮的眼睛（eyes）并列出现在头部同一个视觉平面上，一道长长的伤疤横贯的只能是“脸颊（face）”。","hl":["bright, clear eyes and a long scar"]},{"no":129,"src":"2025·四川资阳·中考真题","stem":"Everyone has something they feel self-conscious about. For me, it was the bright red birthmark on my ____129____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"leg"},{"k":"B","v":"face"},{"k":"C","v":"back"},{"k":"D","v":"foot"}],"answer":"B","clue":"句内后置修饰限制：“the colour of a strawberry... people watching my face”","analysis":"【句内与后句修饰限制】后文提到人们盯着我的脸（watching my face），句内草莓色的胎记正是生长在“脸上（face）”。","hl":[]},{"no":130,"src":"2025·青海·中考真题","stem":"In his hometown, people like eating different kinds of noodles, such as beef noodles and fried noodles, with a bowl of hot ____130____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"soup"},{"k":"B","v":"stone"},{"k":"C","v":"paper"},{"k":"D","v":"ink"}],"answer":"A","clue":"句内同位例证：“beef noodles and fried noodles... a bowl of hot ____”","analysis":"【餐饮习惯限制】与牛肉面、炒面共同端上餐桌的食物配料，在四个选项中只有一碗热气腾腾的“热汤（soup）”符合饮食常理。","hl":["beef noodles and fried noodles","a bowl of hot"]},{"no":131,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"They used sharp knives and special tools to carve a lifelike bird from a single block of hard ____131____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"water"},{"k":"B","v":"air"},{"k":"C","v":"wood"},{"k":"D","v":"cloud"}],"answer":"C","clue":"句内动词与工具限制：“use sharp knives... to carve a lifelike bird”","analysis":"【物理材料限制】雕刻刀具（sharp knives）所能雕刻加工的实体硬质材料，只能是木头（wood）。水、空气、云朵均无法进行物理雕刻。","hl":["sharp knives","to carve a lifelike bird"]},{"no":132,"src":"2025·湖北武汉·中考真题","stem":"The mountain path was muddy and slippery, so Dad reminded us to walk slowly in order not to slip and ____132____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"fly"},{"k":"B","v":"fall"},{"k":"C","v":"swim"},{"k":"D","v":"dance"}],"answer":"B","clue":"句内动作因果限制：“muddy and slippery... in order not to slip and ____”","analysis":"【句内物理因果限制】山路泥泞湿滑，慢步行走是为了防止滑倒（slip）并“摔跤跌落（fall）”。slip and fall 是中考高频动作联结语块。","hl":["muddy and slippery","in order not to slip and"]}]},"ch3#1":{"mech":"3.2","name":"邻句后置反推","qs":[{"no":133,"src":"2025·山东威海·中考真题","stem":"How does a woodpecker prevent brain damage? The secret is that it can wrap its long tongue ____133____ its brain inside its head.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"around"},{"k":"B","v":"along"},{"k":"C","v":"above"},{"k":"D","v":"under"}],"answer":"A","clue":"后句结构保护机制：“protects its brain from injury by wrapping like a belt”","analysis":"【后置线索反推】动词 wrap（包裹/缠绕）与介词 around 构成固定搭配 wrap sth. around sth.（将……缠绕在……周围）。舌头如安全带般绕着大脑盘旋，后文构造反推介词只能选 around。","hl":["its brain"]},{"no":134,"src":"2025·四川广元·中考真题","stem":"The parent bullfinches noticed a heavy cat walking nearby. They took turns watching it to make sure their babies were not in ____134____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"danger"},{"k":"B","v":"peace"},{"k":"C","v":"silence"},{"k":"D","v":"order"}],"answer":"A","clue":"前句天敌大猫巡视与后句防御动作：“heavy cat walking nearby → protect babies”","analysis":"【后置动作反推前文处境】附近出现天敌野猫，鸟爸爸鸟妈妈轮流放哨守护，反推防范的目的必定是确保幼鸟不处于“危险（danger）”之中。in danger 构成固定语块。","hl":["heavy cat walking nearby"]},{"no":135,"src":"2025·江苏宿迁·中考真题","stem":"Mr. Green looked closely at the flooded plant pot. He gently ____135____ the wet soil with his fingers before giving any advice.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"painted"},{"k":"B","v":"checked"},{"k":"C","v":"bought"},{"k":"D","v":"threw"}],"answer":"B","clue":"后句给出诊断结论：“‘You’ve paid too much attention. Soil is too wet!’”","analysis":"【后置语言反推前置动作】邻居老爷爷在给出专业种植诊断之前，用手指拨开泥土进行的动作必然是“检查/仔细查看（checked）”。","hl":[]},{"no":136,"src":"2025·黑龙江大庆·中考真题","stem":"When Amy finally ran to the strawberry field, she couldn't find even half a kilogram to ____136____ her empty basket.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"fill"},{"k":"B","v":"break"},{"k":"C","v":"repair"},{"k":"D","v":"paint"}],"answer":"A","clue":"后句解释原因：“other boys had already picked all the ripe berries”","analysis":"【后置事实反推目的】后文解释其他男孩早已捷足先登把熟草莓摘光了，导致艾米连半公斤草莓都找不到来“装满（fill）”她空空的篮子。","hl":[]},{"no":137,"src":"2025·山东枣庄·中考真题","stem":"After reading his parents’ encouraging letter, he thought about the reasons for his failure ____137____ and made a practical study plan.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"quickly"},{"k":"B","v":"carelessly"},{"k":"C","v":"carefully"},{"k":"D","v":"loudly"}],"answer":"C","clue":"后句切实成效反推：“found out the reasons and made a realistic plan”","analysis":"【后置成效反推行为态度】能够准确查明考试失利的真正根源并制定出切实有效的提升计划，反推其反思失败的过程必定是“认真仔细的（carefully）”。","hl":["and made a"]},{"no":138,"src":"2025·山东泰安·中考真题","stem":"Kellen observed the playground carefully. He noticed that students wearing the buttons began to play with those who had seemed ____138____ before.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"funny"},{"k":"B","v":"lonely"},{"k":"C","v":"rich"},{"k":"D","v":"busy"}],"answer":"B","clue":"前文项目主旨反推：“No one wants to feel like they don’t belong here”","analysis":"【后置互动反推过往状态】徽章项目让原本孤僻的孩子重新融入集体，开始主动和那些从前“孤独落寞的（lonely）”同学一起做游戏。","hl":[]},{"no":139,"src":"2025·四川资阳·中考真题","stem":"Maddie looked at my red birthmark and smiled warmly. “What a beautiful butterfly!” Her words changed my ____139____ completely.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"attitude"},{"k":"B","v":"height"},{"k":"C","v":"clothes"},{"k":"D","v":"age"}],"answer":"A","clue":"后句自信抬头反推：“I no longer hid my face and felt happy”","analysis":"【后置心理行为反推抽象概念】后文写作者不再低头遮掩脸庞并开始接纳自己，反推朋友富有诗意的赞美彻底改变了作者对待自身缺陷的“态度（attitude）”。","hl":[]},{"no":140,"src":"2025·甘肃兰州·中考真题","stem":"Bob saw the lady and the little girl smiling at him. That warm smile made him open his mouth and start to speak ____140____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"angrily"},{"k":"B","v":"proudly"},{"k":"C","v":"bravely"},{"k":"D","v":"silently"}],"answer":"C","clue":"后文由小声变成大声介绍：“raised his head and began to speak louder”","analysis":"【后置行为反推心理状态】原本极度害羞低头的男孩，在顾客笑容鼓励下抬起头大声向路人介绍果汁配方，后置事实反推他迈出了“勇敢的（bravely）”第一步。","hl":[]},{"no":141,"src":"2025·辽宁·中考真题","stem":"Dad looked into the empty car trunk. “Mum, did you bring the food basket?” Mum replied in surprise, “I thought you ____141____ it!”","options":[{"k":"A","v":"ate"},{"k":"B","v":"packed"},{"k":"C","v":"sold"},{"k":"D","v":"dropped"}],"answer":"B","clue":"后文真相揭晓：“they saw the basket inside the front door”","analysis":"【后置事实反推双方误解】后文揭晓篮子被遗忘在家里玄关处，由此反推父母在后备箱找食物时互相以为对方“把篮子装进车里了（packed it）”。","hl":[]},{"no":142,"src":"2025·北京·中考真题","stem":"Making the apple cake every New Year’s Day was not just a meal. It gradually became an important family ____142____ passed down through generations.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"rule"},{"k":"B","v":"tradition"},{"k":"C","v":"secret"},{"k":"D","v":"problem"}],"answer":"B","clue":"后句每年持续与代代相传：“passed down through generations”","analysis":"【后置修饰反推文化定义】每年元旦必做同一道苹果派，并且“代代相传（passed down through generations）”，后置行为直接将其性质定义为家庭的“传统（tradition）”。","hl":["passed down through generations"]},{"no":143,"src":"2025·湖北武汉·中考真题","stem":"The heavy rain trapped us in the shelter. Mom handed us dry biscuits, saying, “Warm ____143____ makes every cold day better.”","options":[{"k":"A","v":"food"},{"k":"B","v":"water"},{"k":"C","v":"wind"},{"k":"D","v":"rain"}],"answer":"A","clue":"前句递饼干的具体行为：“handed us dry biscuits”","analysis":"【前置具体动作反推抽象论述】妈妈递给大家香脆的饼干（biscuits），饼干属于具体事物，其引出的人生慰藉话语必然是“食物（food）能驱散寒冷”。","hl":["handed us dry biscuits"]},{"no":144,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"Public speaking causes great anxiety. ____144____, this fear can be easily overcome with two simple practice methods.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"Luckily"},{"k":"B","v":"Suddenly"},{"k":"C","v":"Sadly"},{"k":"D","v":"Terribly"}],"answer":"A","clue":"后句提供解决良方：“can be easily overcome with two simple methods (+)”","analysis":"【后置转机反推情感副词】前句指明公开演讲是许多人的噩梦（-），后句立刻给出两大简单化解方法（+），后文提供的转机有力反推前句空格必定是“幸运的是（Luckily）”。","hl":["can be easily overcome with two simple"]}]},"ch3#2":{"mech":"3.3","name":"跨段后置证据链","qs":[{"no":145,"src":"2025·江苏宿迁·中考真题","stem":"（首段）Grandma gave Amy a small seed, saying, “Plant it carefully, and you’ll understand its ____145____.” ... （尾段）Grandma smiled, “Aha, Amy! You’ve learned that everything needs patience and love.”","options":[{"k":"A","v":"shape"},{"k":"B","v":"secret"},{"k":"C","v":"name"},{"k":"D","v":"color"}],"answer":"B","clue":"尾段奶奶首尾呼应的台词：“You've known the secret at last.”","analysis":"【跨段后置证据链】首段奶奶设下悬念“种下它你就会明白它的秘密（secret）”，历经全篇艾米焦虑、失败、等待并最终开出向日葵，尾段奶奶再次点题“你终于知道这个秘密了”。首尾跨段揭秘。","hl":[]},{"no":146,"src":"2025·四川资阳·中考真题","stem":"（第2段）I always kept my long hair down to hide my face. I was afraid people would laugh at the red ____146____. ... （末段）Maddie called it a strawberry butterfly, helping me realize everyone is special.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"glasses"},{"k":"B","v":"birthmark"},{"k":"C","v":"hat"},{"k":"D","v":"tooth"}],"answer":"B","clue":"末段朋友的赞美所指：“strawberry butterfly → birthmark”","analysis":"【跨段后置证据链】前段描述用头发拼命遮挡面部，直到后文两个段落通过朋友的赞美，才明确交代这块困扰女孩多年的红色印记是天生的“胎记（birthmark）”。","hl":["strawberry butterfly"]},{"no":147,"src":"2025·广东广州·中考真题","stem":"（第2段）The theatre director was worried because he couldn't find a dog for the play. We worried the missing leg made Lucky a poor choice, but Mr. Lee decided to give him a ____147____. ... （末段）Lucky performed so well that the audience cheered.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"chance"},{"k":"B","v":"gift"},{"k":"C","v":"home"},{"k":"D","v":"prize"}],"answer":"A","clue":"末段小狗惊艳全场的结果反推前段决定：“give him a chance”","analysis":"【跨段后置证据链】前段大家嫌弃三脚犬残疾，导演力排众议决定“给他一次机会（give him a chance）”，后段小狗在舞台上的完美表现充分印证了给予机会的正确性。","hl":["give him a"]},{"no":148,"src":"2025·江苏南通·中考真题","stem":"（第1段）I decorated the cupcakes to look like little sheep by using sweet candies. ... （末段）Sitting in the field under the sky, I shared the ____148____ with my family while watching wild birds.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"cupcakes"},{"k":"B","v":"soup"},{"k":"C","v":"sandwiches"},{"k":"D","v":"apples"}],"answer":"A","clue":"跨越全篇的核心道具：“baked cupcakes in paragraph 1”","analysis":"【跨段后置证据链】首段作者精心烘焙制作的小羊纸杯蛋糕（cupcakes），虽然因车坏未能送到农场，但最终在荒野草地上成为全家人一边赏鸟一边大快朵颐的美食主角。","hl":[]},{"no":149,"src":"2025·四川乐山·中考真题","stem":"（第1段）Mark called the mountain ‘Impossible Hill’ because he couldn’t climb to the top as a child. ... （第4段）Standing at the summit, Mark realized that with patience, no mountain is ____149____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"high"},{"k":"B","v":"impossible"},{"k":"C","v":"small"},{"k":"D","v":"green"}],"answer":"B","clue":"首段山名与末段感悟呼应：“Impossible Hill ↔ nothing is impossible”","analysis":"【跨段后置证据链】首段马克因年幼体弱将高山命名为“不可能之山（Impossible Hill）”，跨越三个段落成功登顶后，马克顿悟坚持能让一切化为可能，没有任何山是“不可能翻越的（impossible）”。","hl":["Impossible Hill"]},{"no":150,"src":"2025·吉林长春·中考真题","stem":"（第2段）Readers were encouraged to pass the borrowed books to other people instead of returning them. ... （末段）A book on Chinese gardens traveled across countries and finally reached ____150____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"Germany"},{"k":"B","v":"America"},{"k":"C","v":"Japan"},{"k":"D","v":"Canada"}],"answer":"A","clue":"末段邻居带书出国的具体目的地：“neighbor took it to Germany”","analysis":"【跨段后置事实印证】前段提出书本自由流转的理念，直到最后一段具体列举了一位读者把园林书传给邻居、邻居又一路将其带到“德国（Germany）”的生动例证。","hl":[]},{"no":151,"src":"2025·山东菏泽·中考真题","stem":"（第3段）Aunt Charlotte carried the hot pie out the back door in silence. ... （末段）I later learned that she had ____151____ the pie to my hungry friend's mother.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"sold"},{"k":"B","v":"given"},{"k":"C","v":"shown"},{"k":"D","v":"lost"}],"answer":"B","clue":"末段揭秘善举：“how to live, how to give and how to share”","analysis":"【跨段后置证据链】前段阿姨悄悄端着派溜出后门是叙事悬念，直到结尾段作者才得知阿姨是把派无偿“送给（given）”了贫困邻居家，升华出“给予与分享（give and share）”的主旨。","hl":[]},{"no":152,"src":"2025·辽宁·中考真题","stem":"（第2段）Dad searched the car for the food basket, but it was nowhere to be found. ... （末段）Opening their front door, they saw the ____152____ safely sitting in the hallway.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"basket"},{"k":"B","v":"tent"},{"k":"C","v":"blanket"},{"k":"D","v":"cake"}],"answer":"A","clue":"第2段丢失悬念与末段门口重现闭环：“food basket nowhere → basket inside front door”","analysis":"【跨段后置证据链】整篇故事的核心悬念就是野餐食物篮神秘失踪引发的一连串囧事，直到文章最后一句开门揭密：篮子（basket）根本没带出门，在家里完好无损。","hl":["food basket"]},{"no":153,"src":"2025·北京·中考真题","stem":"（第1段）Grandpa was the secret master behind the delicious apple cake. ... （末段）Even though Grandpa was in the hospital, the kitchen still had the sweet ____153____ of fresh apples.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"smell"},{"k":"B","v":"light"},{"k":"C","v":"voice"},{"k":"D","v":"sound"}],"answer":"A","clue":"第2段烘焙出炉体验与末段呼应：“smell like apples”","analysis":"【跨段后置证据链】前段描写蛋糕烤好时整个屋子充满苹果香气（smell like apples），末段外公住院时作者独自烤蛋糕，屋里重现熟悉的苹果香气（sweet smell），承载着浓浓的思念。","hl":[]},{"no":154,"src":"2025·黑龙江大庆·中考真题","stem":"（第1段）Amy always wasted time getting prepared instead of taking action. ... （末段）Seeing the empty strawberry field, Amy finally realized that a ____154____ is better than a hundred dreamers.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"doer"},{"k":"B","v":"thinker"},{"k":"C","v":"speaker"},{"k":"D","v":"writer"}],"answer":"A","clue":"首段空想毛病与末段名言揭晓：“doer ↔ dreamers”","analysis":"【跨段首尾对比论证】首段批评艾米总是拖延准备而不去行动（dreamer），末段面对颗粒无收的草莓田，艾米痛定思痛领悟名言：一个实干家（doer）胜过一百个空想家。","hl":[]},{"no":155,"src":"2025·湖北武汉·中考真题","stem":"（第1段）I complained that my birthday was ruined by the sudden mountain storm. ... （末段）Sitting safely by the fireplace drinking chocolate, I smiled, “This was the best birthday ____155____ I ever got.”","options":[{"k":"A","v":"gift"},{"k":"B","v":"cake"},{"k":"C","v":"song"},{"k":"D","v":"card"}],"answer":"A","clue":"首段抱怨没有礼物与尾段升华礼物呼应：“birthday gifts ↔ best birthday gift”","analysis":"【跨段首尾呼应】首段作者还在抱怨因为观鸟遇险错过了家里的生日礼物（gifts），末段在经历风雨安全脱险后，作者真诚地向妈妈感叹：这段难忘的患难经历就是最好的生日礼物（gift）。","hl":["best birthday"]},{"no":156,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"（第1段）The young traveler wondered why the blind man carried a bright lantern at night. ... （第4段）The blind man laughed, “The lantern isn’t for me; it lets others see me so they won’t ____156____ me!”","options":[{"k":"A","v":"hit"},{"k":"B","v":"help"},{"k":"C","v":"teach"},{"k":"D","v":"guide"}],"answer":"A","clue":"第4段盲人亲口揭穿真相：“lets others see me so they won't hit/knock into me”","analysis":"【跨段后置证据链】第1段埋下盲人打灯笼走夜路的巨大悬念，经过两个段落的行路交流，直到第4段盲人才道破天机：灯光是让健全人看见自己，避免在黑夜中“撞到（hit/knock into）”自己。","hl":["lets others see me so they"]}]},"ch3#3":{"mech":"3.4","name":"常识推断与逻辑兜底","qs":[{"no":157,"src":"2025·山东威海·中考真题","stem":"A woodpecker taps its head against wood nearly 12,000 times a day. Think of how you would feel if you hit your head against something ____157____ only once!","options":[{"k":"A","v":"soft"},{"k":"B","v":"smooth"},{"k":"C","v":"hard"},{"k":"D","v":"warm"}],"answer":"C","clue":"生活与物理常识：“hit head against wood（用头撞树干木头）”","analysis":"【常识推断与物理法则】啄木鸟每天啄击坚硬的木头树干，人类类比测试时，用头撞击坚硬物体（hard）一次就会痛彻心扉。撞击软的（soft）或平滑的（smooth）物体与疼痛语境矛盾。","hl":["head against wood"]},{"no":158,"src":"2025·山东潍坊·中考真题","stem":"When someone has diabetes, there is too much ____158____ in their blood, which can cause severe health problems.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"water"},{"k":"B","v":"salt"},{"k":"C","v":"sugar"},{"k":"D","v":"iron"}],"answer":"C","clue":"医学健康常识：“diabetes（糖尿病）的病理常识”","analysis":"【医学科学常识】糖尿病（diabetes）的基本医学常识是人体无法正常代谢糖分，导致血液中“糖分（sugar）”含量过高。血液含糖过高是病症唯一科学解释。","hl":[]},{"no":159,"src":"2025·四川广元·中考真题","stem":"In the cold rainy night, Robbie and I helped Sam put on a thick coat and helped the medical workers carry him into the ____159____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"ambulance"},{"k":"B","v":"classroom"},{"k":"C","v":"library"},{"k":"D","v":"supermarket"}],"answer":"A","clue":"紧急医疗救援常识：“medical workers, carry sick person”","analysis":"【急救生活常识】面对突发急腹症的重病患者，医护人员（medical workers）赶来救援并抬送病人的专用急救车辆必然是救护车（ambulance）。","hl":["medical workers carry"]},{"no":160,"src":"2025·山东青岛·中考真题","stem":"As the sun moves across the sky from rising to setting, the length of the sundial's shadow changes continuously according to ____160____ laws.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"magic"},{"k":"B","v":"natural"},{"k":"C","v":"social"},{"k":"D","v":"secret"}],"answer":"B","clue":"天文自然规律常识：“sun moves from rising to setting”","analysis":"【天文学自然常识】太阳东升西落导致物体影子长短与角度规律性变化，这是全人类皆知的客观“自然（natural）”法则，绝非魔法（magic）或秘密。","hl":["from rising to setting"]},{"no":161,"src":"2025·山西·中考真题","stem":"If a disabled person thinks ‘I am thirsty’, the robotic arm picks up a cup, fills it with water, and gently brings it to his ____161____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"mouth"},{"k":"B","v":"ear"},{"k":"C","v":"eye"},{"k":"D","v":"nose"}],"answer":"A","clue":"生理常识：喝水动作的受体器官：“thirsty → fills cup with water → drink”","analysis":"【生理行为常识】感到口渴（thirsty）需要喝水，机械臂将装满水的杯子递送的目标器官必然是“嘴巴（mouth）”。递到耳朵、眼睛或鼻子均违背基础生活常理。","hl":["with water"]},{"no":162,"src":"2025·四川乐山·中考真题","stem":"Astronauts cannot breathe in outer space because there is no ____162____ outside the spacecraft.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"air"},{"k":"B","v":"fire"},{"k":"C","v":"rock"},{"k":"D","v":"noise"}],"answer":"A","clue":"生物生理常识：“cannot breathe（无法呼吸）的前提条件”","analysis":"【物理与生物常识】太空中无法自主呼吸的科学常识原因在于宇宙空间是高度真空的，太空中没有任何“空气/氧气（air）”。","hl":["cannot breathe"]},{"no":163,"src":"2025·江苏徐州·中考真题","stem":"Both parents had high fevers and couldn’t get out of bed. Peter decided to take care of them and quietly closed the bedroom door so they could ____163____.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"dance"},{"k":"B","v":"rest"},{"k":"C","v":"run"},{"k":"D","v":"shout"}],"answer":"B","clue":"病患照料常识：“high fevers, couldn't get out of bed, closed door quietly”","analysis":"【病人照料生活常识】面对高烧卧床的父母，体贴的孩子轻声关门的最合理目的必然是让病人能够安静地“休息（rest）”。跳舞、跑步严重违背病人常态。","hl":["get out of bed"]},{"no":164,"src":"2025·湖北武汉·中考真题","stem":"The storm knocked down trees and the forest grew pitch black. Dad took out a ____164____ from his backpack to light up the road ahead.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"clock"},{"k":"B","v":"book"},{"k":"C","v":"flashlight"},{"k":"D","v":"radio"}],"answer":"C","clue":"黑夜照明工具常识：“grew pitch black... to light up the road”","analysis":"【野外探险生活常识】森林暴雨漆黑一片无法辨认道路，背包中用来在黑暗中照亮道路前方（light up the road）的照明设备只能是“手电筒（flashlight）”。","hl":["grew pitch black","to light up the road"]},{"no":165,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"Coal is not renewable. When people dig coal out of the ____165____, millions of years of ancient forests are being consumed.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"sky"},{"k":"B","v":"ground"},{"k":"C","v":"water"},{"k":"D","v":"cloud"}],"answer":"B","clue":"矿产地质常识：“dig coal（开采煤炭）”","analysis":"【矿产地理常识】煤炭作为地下化石燃料，人们开采煤炭的物理动作必然是从深层“地下/地面（ground）”将其挖掘出来。","hl":["dig coal"]},{"no":166,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"During Chinese New Year, clean paper bills of ____166____ are put inside red packets and given to kids for good luck.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"letters"},{"k":"B","v":"money"},{"k":"C","v":"stamps"},{"k":"D","v":"leaves"}],"answer":"B","clue":"民俗文化常识：“red packets（红包）”","analysis":"【民俗文化常识】中国农历新年长辈给晚辈发红包（red packets/Hongbao），红包里面装入的崭新纸币必然是“压岁钱（money）”。","hl":["red packets"]},{"no":167,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"Leonardo da Vinci was one of the greatest artists and inventors in world history. He was born and lived in ____167____ during the Renaissance.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"China"},{"k":"B","v":"France"},{"k":"C","v":"Italy"},{"k":"D","v":"America"}],"answer":"C","clue":"历史人物背景常识：“Leonardo da Vinci”","analysis":"【世界历史文化常识】文艺复兴三杰之一的达·芬奇（Leonardo da Vinci）出生并生活在意大利（Italy），属于初中历史与文化必备常识。","hl":["Leonardo da Vinci"]},{"no":168,"src":"2025·山东泰安·中考真题","stem":"Winter on the mountain was freezing cold. Animals grew thicker coats of fur to keep themselves ____168____ in the snow.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"cold"},{"k":"B","v":"warm"},{"k":"C","v":"wet"},{"k":"D","v":"dirty"}],"answer":"B","clue":"动物抗寒生理常识：“freezing cold, thicker coats of fur”","analysis":"【生物自然适应常识】寒冬时节高山严寒，野生动物长出更厚密的毛皮，其生物学进化功能是为了在冰雪中抵御严寒“保暖（keep warm）”。","hl":["thicker coats of fur"]}]},"ch3#4":{"mech":"3.5","name":"同位解释与破折号定音","qs":[{"no":169,"src":"2025·江苏常州·中考真题","stem":"Kit had a long red scar running down her left cheek—a permanent ____169____ reminding her of an old bicycle accident.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"mask"},{"k":"B","v":"mark"},{"k":"C","v":"guess"},{"k":"D","v":"dream"}],"answer":"B","clue":"破折号同位解释：“a long red scar—a permanent ____”","analysis":"【破折号同位解释】破折号之后是对前文 scar（伤疤）的同位语解释。伤疤在生物体表面留下的持久物理痕迹，最精准的同位名词是“印记/痕迹（mark）”。","hl":["a long red scar"]},{"no":170,"src":"2025·北京·中考真题","stem":"I finally got the master recipe from Grandpa—the step-by-step ____170____ for creating the city's best apple cake.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"rule"},{"k":"B","v":"guide"},{"k":"C","v":"story"},{"k":"D","v":"game"}],"answer":"B","clue":"破折号同位解释：“recipe—the step-by-step ____”","analysis":"【破折号同位解释】破折号对前面的独家食谱（recipe）进行同位解释：制作苹果派的一步一步的具体“指南/指导步骤（guide）”。recipe 与 guide 构成同位等价转换。","hl":["the step-by-step"]},{"no":171,"src":"2025·浙江·中考真题","stem":"Her mother’s three phrases weren't just simple words; they were a compass—a reliable ____171____ guiding her towards a life filled with purpose.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"tool"},{"k":"B","v":"book"},{"k":"C","v":"toy"},{"k":"D","v":"clock"}],"answer":"A","clue":"破折号同位解释：“a compass—a reliable ____”","analysis":"【破折号同位解释】破折号对前面的指南针（compass）进行上位概念解释：指南针是指引人生方向的可靠“工具（tool）”。","hl":["a compass—a reliable"]},{"no":172,"src":"2025·四川凉山·中考真题","stem":"Mosuo people still speak their ancient language—Mosuo, a special ____172____ passed down orally from mother to child.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"letter"},{"k":"B","v":"tongue"},{"k":"C","v":"song"},{"k":"D","v":"law"}],"answer":"B","clue":"逗号同位语解释：“Mosuo, a special ____ passed down orally”","analysis":"【逗号同位语解释】逗号后面的短语是对摩梭语的同位解释。tongue 拥有母语/方言（language）的高级书面语含义，a special tongue 完美对应 language。","hl":["Mosuo, a special"]},{"no":173,"src":"2025·山东青岛·中考真题","stem":"In Chinese culture, we often use ‘drinking ink’—a common ____173____ to describe a person who is well educated.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"expression"},{"k":"B","v":"question"},{"k":"C","v":"lie"},{"k":"D","v":"decision"}],"answer":"A","clue":"破折号同位解释：“‘drinking ink’—a common ____”","analysis":"【破折号同位语解释】“喝墨水”被破折号直接解释为一个用来形容人受过良好教育的常见“俗语/表达方式（expression）”。","hl":["drinking ink’—a common"]},{"no":174,"src":"2025·山西·中考真题","stem":"Beinao-1 acts as a neural translator—a magical bridge connecting the human ____174____ with modern machines.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"mind"},{"k":"B","v":"foot"},{"k":"C","v":"cloth"},{"k":"D","v":"house"}],"answer":"A","clue":"破折号同位解释：“neural translator—a bridge connecting human ____”","analysis":"【破折号同位解释】脑机接口设备被同位解释为连接人脑与机器的桥梁，负责发出神经信号的核心主体是人类的“大脑思维/心灵（mind）”。","hl":["neural translator—a"]},{"no":175,"src":"2025·吉林长春·中考真题","stem":"Xu opened the micro-library in a small hutong—a narrow traditional ____175____ in old Beijing.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"street"},{"k":"B","v":"mountain"},{"k":"C","v":"river"},{"k":"D","v":"bridge"}],"answer":"A","clue":"破折号同位解释：“hutong—a narrow traditional ____”","analysis":"【文化词汇同位语解释】破折号直接对专有名词“胡同（hutong）”进行英文通俗解释：老北京狭窄的传统“小街道/巷子（street）”。","hl":["hutong—a narrow traditional"]},{"no":176,"src":"2025·四川乐山·中考真题","stem":"Wang Haoze was selected for Shenzhou-19—China’s latest manned ____176____ traveling to the space station.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"mission"},{"k":"B","v":"plane"},{"k":"C","v":"train"},{"k":"D","v":"car"}],"answer":"A","clue":"破折号同位解释：“Shenzhou-19—China’s latest manned ____”","analysis":"【破折号同位解释】破折号对“神舟十九号”进行性质界定：中国最新的载人航天“飞行任务（manned mission）”。","hl":["Shenzhou-19—China’s latest manned"]},{"no":177,"src":"2025·四川资阳·中考真题","stem":"My mother called the red mark a strawberry—a sweet ____177____ that makes you unique among all children.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"gift"},{"k":"B","v":"punishment"},{"k":"C","v":"trouble"},{"k":"D","v":"mistake"}],"answer":"A","clue":"破折号同位解释：“a strawberry—a sweet ____”","analysis":"【破折号同位解释】母亲慈爱地把胎记比作草莓，破折号后将其解释为让你与众不同的一份甜蜜的“生命礼物（sweet gift）”。","hl":["a strawberry—a sweet"]},{"no":178,"src":"2025·山东泰安·中考真题","stem":"Kellen created Project Belonging—a student-led ____178____ designed to help every lonely kid find friends.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"program"},{"k":"B","v":"test"},{"k":"C","v":"game"},{"k":"D","v":"exam"}],"answer":"A","clue":"破折号同位解释：“Project Belonging—a student-led ____”","analysis":"【破折号同位解释】破折号对“归属感项目（Project Belonging）”进行同义解释：一个由学生自发主导发起的校园公益“项目/计划（program）”。","hl":["Project Belonging—a student-led"]},{"no":179,"src":"2025·湖北武汉·中考真题","stem":"Dad checked his compass—a magnetic ____179____ that always points directly towards the North.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"device"},{"k":"B","v":"book"},{"k":"C","v":"paper"},{"k":"D","v":"food"}],"answer":"A","clue":"破折号同位解释：“compass—a magnetic ____ that points North”","analysis":"【破折号同位解释】破折号对指南针（compass）进行物理功能解释：一个始终指向北方的磁性机械“仪器/装置（magnetic device）”。","hl":["compass—a magnetic"]},{"no":180,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"They used a sundial, that is, an ancient sun-based ____180____, to tell the exact hour of the day.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"timer"},{"k":"B","v":"light"},{"k":"C","v":"mirror"},{"k":"D","v":"stone"}],"answer":"A","clue":"that is 短语同位解释：“sundial, that is, an ancient sun-based ____”","analysis":"【that is 引导同位解释】过渡短语 that is（换言之/即）后紧跟同位语，将日晷解释为利用太阳影子报时的古代“计时器（timer）”。","hl":["sundial, that is, an ancient sun-based"]}]},"ch4#0":{"mech":"4.1","name":"并列与顺承逻辑","qs":[{"no":181,"src":"2025·四川凉山·中考真题","stem":"It is a large lake surrounded by high mountains ____181____ lush green trees, creating a peaceful paradise.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"and"},{"k":"B","v":"but"},{"k":"C","v":"or"},{"k":"D","v":"so"}],"answer":"A","clue":"并列名词短语：“high mountains [____] lush green trees”","analysis":"【并列逻辑】高山（mountains）与绿树（trees）是构成湖泊周围自然美景的两个并列成分，前后语义方向同向顺承，用并列连词 and 连接。","hl":["lush green trees"]},{"no":182,"src":"2025·江苏徐州·中考真题","stem":"Peter started to read the story out loud, ____182____ after a short while, he began imagining that he was the hero flying in the sky.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"and"},{"k":"B","v":"but"},{"k":"C","v":"so"},{"k":"D","v":"or"}],"answer":"A","clue":"叙事顺承推进：“read story out loud [____] after a short while began imagining”","analysis":"【顺承推进逻辑】前分句大声朗读故事，顺承推进到片刻之后沉浸其中展开想象，前后情节自然流淌递进，用并列连词 and 顺畅衔接。","hl":["after a short while"]},{"no":183,"src":"2025·山东菏泽·中考真题","stem":"I talked to the boy, we built up a close friendship, ____183____ we played outside happily together for the next few days.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"and"},{"k":"B","v":"but"},{"k":"C","v":"though"},{"k":"D","v":"unless"}],"answer":"A","clue":"三连动顺承：“talked [,] built up friendship [,] [____] played outside”","analysis":"【三重动作并列顺承】交谈（talked）→ 建立友谊（built up friendship）→ 一起在外面玩耍（played outside），三个分句构成标准的连续顺承关系，用 and 连接最后一项。","hl":["played outside"]},{"no":184,"src":"2025·北京·中考真题","stem":"Grandpa could peel an apple in one continuous strip. Then we would mix everything ____184____ put the cake into the hot oven.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"and"},{"k":"B","v":"or"},{"k":"C","v":"but"},{"k":"D","v":"because"}],"answer":"A","clue":"烘焙连续工序：“mix everything [____] put cake into oven”","analysis":"【工序动作顺承】混合面糊（mix everything）与送入烤箱（put into oven）是烘焙过程中紧密衔接的先后物理步骤，用 and 连接并列谓语。","hl":["mix everything"]},{"no":185,"src":"2025·辽宁·中考真题","stem":"Jack put down the cake, ran to the seashore, ____185____ played the game Treasure Hunt happily with his parents.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"and"},{"k":"B","v":"but"},{"k":"C","v":"so"},{"k":"D","v":"or"}],"answer":"A","clue":"海滩动作链：“put down [,] ran [,] [____] played”","analysis":"【并列动作链条】放下蛋糕、跑向海边、与父母玩寻宝游戏，三个动词过去式由逗号和 and 构成工整的先后顺承链条。","hl":["put down"]},{"no":186,"src":"2025·四川乐山·中考真题","stem":"Mark listened to his dad's advice, smiled warmly, ____186____ nodded his head firmly to show his determination.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"and"},{"k":"B","v":"but"},{"k":"C","v":"or"},{"k":"D","v":"so"}],"answer":"A","clue":"心理与肢体顺承动作：“smiled warmly [____] nodded his head”","analysis":"【顺承逻辑】听完父亲开导后，马克微笑并坚定地点头，两个肢体动作是内心情绪转化的同向连续表达，用 and 连接。","hl":["nodded his head"]},{"no":187,"src":"2025·吉林长春·中考真题","stem":"The neighbor finished reading the gardening book ____187____ then brought it along on his trip all the way to Germany.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"and"},{"k":"B","v":"but"},{"k":"C","v":"though"},{"k":"D","v":"if"}],"answer":"A","clue":"时间副词 then 伴随顺承：“finished reading [____] then brought it”","analysis":"【顺承连词搭配】and then 是英语叙事中最经典的顺承语块，读完书之后将其带上跨国旅途，动作时序紧密相连。","hl":["then brought it"]},{"no":188,"src":"2025·山东青岛·中考真题","stem":"Language learning helps us understand the culture behind idioms ____188____ communicate better with people from around the world.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"and"},{"k":"B","v":"but"},{"k":"C","v":"or"},{"k":"D","v":"unless"}],"answer":"A","clue":"并列不定式目标：“understand culture [____] communicate better”","analysis":"【目标并列逻辑】学习语言的两大积极收益：理解文化（understand culture）与更好沟通（communicate better），前后并列齐驱，用 and 连接。","hl":["communicate better"]},{"no":189,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"There was no pen ____189____ paper in the poor village school, so the teacher used sticks to write on the sand.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"and"},{"k":"B","v":"or"},{"k":"C","v":"but"},{"k":"D","v":"so"}],"answer":"B","clue":"否定句中的并列连词：“no pen [____] paper”","analysis":"【否定句并列连词 or】在肯定句中表示并列用 and，但在全部否定句（no / not）中，表示“既没有笔也没有纸”，并列连词必须使用 or。","hl":[]},{"no":190,"src":"2025·四川广元·中考真题","stem":"The parents flew back to the nest, fed the two hungry babies, ____190____ chirped softly to comfort them.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"and"},{"k":"B","v":"but"},{"k":"C","v":"although"},{"k":"D","v":"because"}],"answer":"A","clue":"鸟类抚幼动作连：“flew back [,] fed babies [,] [____] chirped softly”","analysis":"【连续动作顺承】灰雀父母飞回巢穴、喂养幼鸟、轻柔啼叫安抚，三个动词分句构成和谐的亲鸟哺育动作链，最后一项用 and 连结。","hl":["flew back"]}]},"ch4#1":{"mech":"4.2","name":"转折与对比逻辑","qs":[{"no":191,"src":"2025·江苏南通·中考真题","stem":"We never made it to Aunt Jen’s farm party, ____191____ that didn’t matter at all because we enjoyed the wonderful wild birds.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"and"},{"k":"B","v":"or"},{"k":"C","v":"but"},{"k":"D","v":"so"}],"answer":"C","clue":"未达目的地与不在乎的转折：“never made it [____] that didn’t matter”","analysis":"【转折逻辑】前半句客观陈述遗憾（没能赶到派对），后半句主观心态转变（那完全没关系），前后构成强烈的意义逆转，选转折连词 but。","hl":["that didn’t matter"]},{"no":192,"src":"2025·江苏常州·中考真题","stem":"On the outside, Emma looked taller and stronger than others; ____192____ on the inside, she felt very small and self-conscious.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"but"},{"k":"B","v":"so"},{"k":"C","v":"or"},{"k":"D","v":"because"}],"answer":"A","clue":"外表与内心剧烈反差：“on the outside (+) ↔ on the inside (-)”","analysis":"【对比转折逻辑】极其工整的对照结构：外表看起来比同龄人高大强壮，而内心深处却极度自卑敏感。外在与内在相反对立，使用转折连词 but。","hl":["On the outside"]},{"no":193,"src":"2025·四川乐山·中考真题","stem":"The mountain was steep and rocky, ____193____ Mark never gave up and pushed forward bravely step by step.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"but"},{"k":"B","v":"and"},{"k":"C","v":"so"},{"k":"D","v":"or"}],"answer":"A","clue":"山势险峻与坚决不放弃对比：“steep and rocky ↔ never gave up”","analysis":"【转折对比逻辑】客观条件极度艰难险阻，主观意志坚决顽强不放弃，前后分句构成典型逆境突围转折，选 but。","hl":["steep and rocky"]},{"no":194,"src":"2025·山东潍坊·中考真题","stem":"Many deaths from heart disease could be prevented. ____194____, people still eat too much sugar and rarely do sports.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"However"},{"k":"B","v":"Therefore"},{"k":"C","v":"Besides"},{"k":"D","v":"Since"}],"answer":"A","clue":"本可避免与依然放纵反差：“could be prevented ↔ still eat too much sugar”","analysis":"【转折副词 However】前句说明悲剧本可通过健康生活方式避免，后句用逗号隔开，指出人们现实中依然大吃甜食不锻炼，前后转折，副词选 However。","hl":["still eat too much sugar"]},{"no":195,"src":"2025·四川乐山·中考真题","stem":"Wang Haoze faced brutal challenges at sea and in the desert. ____195____, nothing could make her give up her space dream.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"However"},{"k":"B","v":"Therefore"},{"k":"C","v":"Or"},{"k":"D","v":"So"}],"answer":"A","clue":"残酷磨难与永不言弃反差：“brutal challenges ↔ nothing could make her give up”","analysis":"【转折副词 However】极限严酷的野外生存训练无法阻挡飞天梦想，前后分句形成坚毅的精神逆转，逗号隔开位于句首，选转折副词 However。","hl":["nothing could make her give up"]},{"no":196,"src":"2025·山东枣庄·中考真题","stem":"Everyone in the world wants to win every game, ____196____ none of them can always win without experiencing failure.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"but"},{"k":"B","v":"or"},{"k":"C","v":"so"},{"k":"D","v":"though"}],"answer":"A","clue":"人人都想赢与无人能常胜的对立：“everyone wants to win ↔ none can always win”","analysis":"【转折逻辑】主观美好愿望（人人都想一直赢）与残酷客观规律（没有人能永远不输）形成对比，并列连词选 but。","hl":["wants to win"]},{"no":197,"src":"2025·四川资阳·中考真题","stem":"Sometimes I felt like people were staring at my birthmark. ____197____ when I turned my head, they quickly looked away.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"But"},{"k":"B","v":"Because"},{"k":"C","v":"If"},{"k":"D","v":"So"}],"answer":"A","clue":"感觉被注视与转头没人的落差：“felt staring ↔ looked away”","analysis":"【转折逻辑】总觉得别人在背后指指点点盯着自己看，但猛一回头对方却早已移开目光，情节转折打破前句假设，选 But。","hl":["looked away"]},{"no":198,"src":"2025·吉林长春·中考真题","stem":"The micro-library had to move three times due to rent problems. ____198____, it is still alive and thriving today.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"However"},{"k":"B","v":"Besides"},{"k":"C","v":"For example"},{"k":"D","v":"As a result"}],"answer":"A","clue":"三次被迫搬迁与依然顽强存续：“moved three times ↔ still alive today”","analysis":"【转折副词 However】前句交代因为租金问题历经三次搬家动荡，后句点明直到今天依然充满生机地存在着，逗号隔开转折副词选 However。","hl":["three times"]},{"no":199,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"Study hard every day, ____199____ you will fail the final exam and fall behind others.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"and"},{"k":"B","v":"or"},{"k":"C","v":"but"},{"k":"D","v":"so"}],"answer":"B","clue":"祈使句警示结构：“祈使句 + or + 陈述句（否则……）”","analysis":"【连词 or 否定义转折】“祈使句, or + 句子”是初中英语高频句型，or 在此表示“否则的话”，连接反面警告结果。","hl":[]},{"no":200,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"He had a large store of grain in his barn, but ____200____ consuming it all immediately, he saved half for the spring sowing.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"other than"},{"k":"B","v":"as well as"},{"k":"C","v":"instead of"},{"k":"D","v":"more than"}],"answer":"C","clue":"正反取舍介词短语：“[____] consuming immediately, saved half”","analysis":"【取舍对比 instead of】介词短语 instead of 意为“代替，而不是”，后接被主动放弃的动作（立刻吃光），主句则是真正执行的明智之举（存留一半）。","hl":["saved half"]}]},"ch4#2":{"mech":"4.3","name":"因果推导逻辑","qs":[{"no":201,"src":"2025·江苏南通·中考真题","stem":"My family had never done anything different before, ____201____ when Aunt Jen invited us to the farm party, I was thrilled.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"so"},{"k":"B","v":"but"},{"k":"C","v":"although"},{"k":"D","v":"unless"}],"answer":"A","clue":"前因后果：“never done anything different (因) → thrilled (果)”","analysis":"【因果逻辑】前分句交代原因（全家人以前从没有尝试过什么新鲜事），后分句引出自然结果（所以收到农场邀请时极其兴奋），用连词 so 连接结果。","hl":["never done anything different"]},{"no":202,"src":"2025·四川凉山·中考真题","stem":"I worked very hard to get good grades ____202____ I believed that knowledge was the key to my bright future.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"because"},{"k":"B","v":"though"},{"k":"C","v":"so"},{"k":"D","v":"but"}],"answer":"A","clue":"前果后因：“worked hard (果) ← knowledge was key to future (因)”","analysis":"【因果连词 because】前句是行为结果（努力学习考好成绩），后句从句揭示内驱动机（因为深信知识是美好未来的关键），从句前使用 because。","hl":["knowledge was"]},{"no":203,"src":"2025·江苏宿迁·中考真题","stem":"I have spent years growing plants, and you have spent only four days. ____203____ you need to be more patient.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"Or"},{"k":"B","v":"But"},{"k":"C","v":"So"},{"k":"D","v":"Yet"}],"answer":"C","clue":"自然生长规律前因引出结论建议：“only spent four days (因) → need patience (果)”","analysis":"【因果连词 So】格林先生指出植物生长需要遵循自然时钟，艾米才种了四天，因果顺承得出结论：“所以你需要更有耐心（So you need to be patient）”。","hl":["four days","you need to be"]},{"no":204,"src":"2025·黑龙江大庆·中考真题","stem":"Amy was excited about making money to help her mom, ____204____ she quickly ran home to fetch a big basket.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"so"},{"k":"B","v":"although"},{"k":"C","v":"because"},{"k":"D","v":"if"}],"answer":"A","clue":"动机驱动物理动作：“excited about making money (因) → ran home (果)”","analysis":"【因果连词 so】前因（渴望采草莓赚钱帮妈妈）直接触发了后续的物理动作（所以立刻飞奔回家拿篮子），前后构成因果链条，选 so。","hl":["excited about making money"]},{"no":205,"src":"2025·山东泰安·中考真题","stem":"No one wants to feel like they don’t belong here. That’s ____205____ he came up with Project Belonging.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"how"},{"k":"B","v":"why"},{"k":"C","v":"when"},{"k":"D","v":"where"}],"answer":"B","clue":"前因引出创举结果：“That's why...（这就是为什么……）”","analysis":"【因果表语从句 That's why】前句交代同理心原因（没有人想在学校孤立无援），后句用固定因果句型 That’s why...（这就是他发起该项目的原因）引出结果。","hl":[]},{"no":206,"src":"2025·青海·中考真题","stem":"He has fallen in love with cooking ____206____ it brings true happiness to his family and helps him relax after work.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"because"},{"k":"B","v":"so"},{"k":"C","v":"unless"},{"k":"D","v":"though"}],"answer":"A","clue":"爱上下厨的深度缘由：“fell in love with cooking ← brings happiness”","analysis":"【因果连词 because】前句是心理喜好结果（爱上下厨），后句是从句解释深层缘由（因为能给全家带来幸福），引导原因状语从句选 because。","hl":["in love with cooking"]},{"no":207,"src":"2025·山东青岛·中考真题","stem":"In ancient times, people in Northern Qi took exams. Those who performed badly were punished to drink ink. ____207____, ‘drinking ink’ became an idiom.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"Thus"},{"k":"B","v":"But"},{"k":"C","v":"Although"},{"k":"D","v":"Or"}],"answer":"A","clue":"历史典故引出成语定型结果：“punished to drink ink (因) → became an idiom (果)”","analysis":"【因果副词 Thus】前句交代历史背景故事，后句由此水到渠成地引出成语诞生的历史结果，因果副词选 Thus（因此/由此）。","hl":["punished to drink ink"]},{"no":208,"src":"2025·湖北武汉·中考真题","stem":"The mountain ground was muddy and slippery, ____208____ Dad kept reminding us to watch our steps carefully.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"so"},{"k":"B","v":"because"},{"k":"C","v":"but"},{"k":"D","v":"though"}],"answer":"A","clue":"路滑危险引出父亲叮嘱：“ground muddy and slippery (因) → reminded us (果)”","analysis":"【因果连词 so】路面泥泞湿滑容易摔倒（前因），所以父亲一路上不停提醒大家慢点走看清脚下（后果），因果连词选 so。","hl":["muddy and slippery"]},{"no":209,"src":"2025·四川乐山·中考真题","stem":"During her university time, Wang Haoze showed remarkable learning ability, ____209____ she was always at the top of her class.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"so"},{"k":"B","v":"but"},{"k":"C","v":"though"},{"k":"D","v":"until"}],"answer":"A","clue":"学习能力极强导致名列前茅：“remarkable learning ability (因) → top of class (果)”","analysis":"【因果连词 so】展现出惊人的学习领悟能力（原因），由此顺理成章导致其考试成绩始终在全班名列前茅（结果），选 so。","hl":["remarkable learning ability"]},{"no":210,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"The whole class listened very carefully, ____210____ they were all worried that they might fail the difficult special test.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"because"},{"k":"B","v":"so"},{"k":"C","v":"though"},{"k":"D","v":"unless"}],"answer":"A","clue":"专心听讲背后的担忧原因：“listened carefully (果) ← worried about failure (因)”","analysis":"【因果连词 because】全班同学屏息凝神极度专注听老师讲话，从句解释背后的原因是大家担心自己无法通过这场突击特殊考试，选 because。","hl":[]}]},"ch4#3":{"mech":"4.4","name":"让步转折逻辑","qs":[{"no":211,"src":"2025·江苏常州·中考真题","stem":"____211____ the loud classmates could jog faster than Emma, they preferred to stay behind her just to laugh at her.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"Although"},{"k":"B","v":"Because"},{"k":"C","v":"Since"},{"k":"D","v":"As"}],"answer":"A","clue":"明明跑得快却偏偏滞后嘲弄：“[____] could run faster, preferred to stay behind”","analysis":"【让步连词 Although】虽然那群同学体能好、本来跑得比艾米快（让步承认能力），但他们偏偏故意慢跑在艾米身后对其指指点点。虽然……但是……的让步关系，选 Although。","hl":["preferred to stay behind"]},{"no":212,"src":"2025·四川资阳·中考真题","stem":"Try to stick to your schedule, ____212____ it is not easy or sometimes very tiring at the beginning.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"even when"},{"k":"B","v":"because"},{"k":"C","v":"so that"},{"k":"D","v":"since"}],"answer":"A","clue":"克服起步阶段的疲惫：“stick to schedule [____] not easy or tiring”","analysis":"【让步连词 even when】号召坚持执行计划，哪怕在起步阶段这并不容易、甚至让人感到疲惫不堪，even when（即使当……的时候/哪怕）引导让步状语。","hl":["not easy or"]},{"no":213,"src":"2025·北京·中考真题","stem":"____213____ Grandpa was lying in the hospital bed far away, it felt as if we were still baking the apple cake together in the kitchen.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"Even though"},{"k":"B","v":"Because"},{"k":"C","v":"If"},{"k":"D","v":"Unless"}],"answer":"A","clue":"身在医院与仿佛同在反衬：“[____] Grandpa was in hospital, felt as if together”","analysis":"【让步连词 Even though】外公虽然远在病房接受治疗（退一步承认残酷现实），但亲情与香气让全家感觉外公仿佛就在身边。Even though（即使/尽管）引导让步从句。","hl":["felt as if"]},{"no":214,"src":"2025·山东泰安·中考真题","stem":"____214____ Kellen was only nine years old, he had the maturity and kindness to launch a school-wide project for lonely kids.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"Although"},{"k":"B","v":"Because"},{"k":"C","v":"Until"},{"k":"D","v":"Since"}],"answer":"A","clue":"年仅九岁与发起全校大项目的反衬：“[____] only nine years old, launched project”","analysis":"【让步连词 Although】虽然年龄只有小小的九岁（让步），却拥有超越年龄的成熟与大爱，反衬其精神品质的可贵，选 Although。","hl":["only nine years old"]},{"no":215,"src":"2025·湖北武汉·中考真题","stem":"Half an hour passed, ____215____ the heavy storm still showed no signs of stopping.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"but"},{"k":"B","v":"so"},{"k":"C","v":"because"},{"k":"D","v":"if"}],"answer":"A","clue":"时间流逝与暴雨依旧反差：“Half an hour passed [____] rain didn't stop”","analysis":"【轻度让步转折】半个小时漫长的时间过去了，然而暴雨丝毫没有停歇的迹象，前后分句构成时间期待落空的转折，选 but。","hl":["Half an hour passed"]},{"no":216,"src":"2025·四川乐山·中考真题","stem":"Mark's legs felt sore and heavy. ____216____ he was exhausted, he insisted on carrying the heavy backpack for his father.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"Though"},{"k":"B","v":"Because"},{"k":"C","v":"Unless"},{"k":"D","v":"Since"}],"answer":"A","clue":"极度疲惫依然帮父亲负重反衬：“[____] exhausted, insisted on carrying”","analysis":"【让步连词 Though】虽然双腿酸痛、整个人筋疲力尽（让步），依然坚持为父亲分担沉重的背包，体现孝心与坚毅，选 Though。","hl":["insisted on carrying"]},{"no":217,"src":"2025·辽宁·中考真题","stem":"____217____ things didn’t turn out 100% perfect, Jack smiled and said it was the most memorable birthday he ever had.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"Although"},{"k":"B","v":"Because"},{"k":"C","v":"If"},{"k":"D","v":"Unless"}],"answer":"A","clue":"美中不足与终生难忘反衬：“[____] not 100% perfect, most memorable”","analysis":"【让步连词 Although】尽管这一天意外频出、未能尽善尽美（承认遗憾），但对杰克来说却充满了欢笑与温情，是最难忘的生日，选 Although。","hl":["100% perfect"]},{"no":218,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"I’d like to have a brave try, ____218____ I know I may fail and face laughter.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"though"},{"k":"B","v":"since"},{"k":"C","v":"until"},{"k":"D","v":"after"}],"answer":"A","clue":"明知可能失败依然渴望尝试：“have a brave try [____] may fail”","analysis":"【让步连词 though】主句表达勇敢一试的决心，后半句从句承认自己清楚可能面临失败，though（尽管/即使）连接让步从句。","hl":["have a brave try"]},{"no":219,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"____219____ jeans were invented over 100 years ago, they are still fashionable all around the world today.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"Because"},{"k":"B","v":"If"},{"k":"C","v":"Although"},{"k":"D","v":"Since"}],"answer":"C","clue":"百年前发明与至今风靡全球反差：“[____] invented 100 years ago, still in fashion”","analysis":"【让步连词 Although】虽然牛仔裤早在一百多年前就已问世，但直到今天依然风靡全球，年代久远与时下流行构成反衬，选 Although。","hl":["100 years ago"]},{"no":220,"src":"2025·四川广元·中考真题","stem":"____220____ we only slept for three hours and were very tired, we felt glad for having saved Sam in time.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"Although"},{"k":"B","v":"Because"},{"k":"C","v":"If"},{"k":"D","v":"Unless"}],"answer":"A","clue":"熬夜疲惫与救助成功的欣慰反差：“[____] tired, felt glad for saving Sam”","analysis":"【让步连词 Although】虽然整夜未眠身体极其困顿疲惫，但内心却因及时拯救了生病的同学而充满成就感与欣慰，选 Although。","hl":["felt glad for"]}]},"ch4#4":{"mech":"4.5","name":"条件假设逻辑","qs":[{"no":221,"src":"2025·四川资阳·中考真题","stem":"Plans are flexible. ____221____ you find that an outdoor plan is not working due to bad weather, you can make some changes.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"Before"},{"k":"B","v":"Although"},{"k":"C","v":"Unless"},{"k":"D","v":"If"}],"answer":"D","clue":"假设户外计划行不通的前提：“[____] you find plan not working, make changes”","analysis":"【条件假设连词 If】作者提出应变法则：如果（If）在现实中你发现由于天气原因原有计划无法执行，那么你可以适时做出调整。","hl":["you find"]},{"no":222,"src":"2025·甘肃兰州·中考真题","stem":"Bob realized that ____222____ he dared to raise his head and speak up, he would definitely gain more confidence.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"before"},{"k":"B","v":"no matter how"},{"k":"C","v":"unless"},{"k":"D","v":"as long as"}],"answer":"D","clue":"充分条件达成结果：“[____] dared to raise head → gain confidence”","analysis":"【条件短语 as long as】鲍勃领悟到自信的真谛：只要（as long as）自己勇敢抬起头开口说话，就必定能赢得更多的自信。as long as 引导充分条件从句。","hl":["dared to raise"]},{"no":223,"src":"2025·吉林长春·中考真题","stem":"Xu shares his reading lists online. ____223____ readers cannot find those books locally, he will mail them for free.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"If"},{"k":"B","v":"Although"},{"k":"C","v":"Because"},{"k":"D","v":"Until"}],"answer":"A","clue":"免费邮寄图书的触发条件：“[____] cannot find books locally, mail for free”","analysis":"【条件状语从句 If】徐大伟提供公益免费邮寄的前提条件是：如果（If）读者在当地图书馆确实借阅不到这些好书，他就会自掏邮费寄去。","hl":["cannot find"]},{"no":224,"src":"2025·四川凉山·中考真题","stem":"____224____ you visit Lugu Lake during the holiday, you can dance around the warm bonfire with the local people.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"If"},{"k":"B","v":"Because"},{"k":"C","v":"Though"},{"k":"D","v":"Unless"}],"answer":"A","clue":"游览泸沽湖的假设前提：“[____] you visit Lugu Lake, can dance”","analysis":"【条件连词 If】作者向游客发出热情向往推荐：如果你（If）在假期前往泸沽湖旅游，你就能与淳朴的当地人围着篝火跳舞。","hl":["you visit Lugu Lake"]},{"no":225,"src":"2025·山西·中考真题","stem":"For example, ____225____ a paralyzed patient thinks ‘I want to drink water’, the smart robotic arm will immediately act.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"if"},{"k":"B","v":"although"},{"k":"C","v":"unless"},{"k":"D","v":"because"}],"answer":"A","clue":"意念触发机械臂的前提：“[____] patient thinks ‘drink water’, arm acts”","analysis":"【条件连词 if】脑机接口设备运作原理示范：如果（if）瘫痪病人在脑海中产生喝水意念，机械臂就会接收指令行动。","hl":["patient thinks","drink water"]},{"no":226,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"You will never make real progress in your English studies ____226____ you practice reading and speaking every single day.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"if"},{"k":"B","v":"unless"},{"k":"C","v":"though"},{"k":"D","v":"since"}],"answer":"B","clue":"否定反面假设：“never make progress [____] you practice (除非每天练习)”","analysis":"【否定条件连词 unless】unless 相当于 if... not。主句表示你绝不可能取得实质进步，除非（unless）你能够坚持每天听说读写。表示排他性必要条件。","hl":["never make"]},{"no":227,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"“I didn’t steal the money, Grandma,” the boy cried honestly. “____227____ you love me, you should trust my words.”","options":[{"k":"A","v":"If"},{"k":"B","v":"Because"},{"k":"C","v":"Although"},{"k":"D","v":"Unless"}],"answer":"A","clue":"基于爱的信任前提：“[____] you love me, should trust me”","analysis":"【条件连词 If】男孩恳请奶奶相信自己的清白：如果你（If）爱我，你就应该相信我说的人格真话。","hl":["you love me"]},{"no":228,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"You don't need a hundred friends in life ____228____ they are truly loyal and sincere to you.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"as well as"},{"k":"B","v":"as far as"},{"k":"C","v":"as long as"},{"k":"D","v":"as soon as"}],"answer":"C","clue":"朋友贵在真诚的充分条件：“don't need hundred [____] truly loyal”","analysis":"【条件短语 as long as】人生不需要成百上千个酒肉朋友，只要（as long as）身边的朋友对你真正真诚忠实就足够了。","hl":["don't need"]},{"no":229,"src":"2025·山东潍坊·中考真题","stem":"Our health will definitely decline ____229____ we change our sedentary habits and do regular aerobic workouts.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"if"},{"k":"B","v":"unless"},{"k":"C","v":"because"},{"k":"D","v":"though"}],"answer":"B","clue":"健康必然下滑的唯一防线：“health decline [____] change sedentary habits”","analysis":"【否定条件连词 unless】我们的身体健康必将不可逆转地下滑，除非（unless）我们立刻改变久坐不动的恶习并坚持锻炼。","hl":["sedentary habits"]},{"no":230,"src":"2025·湖北武汉·中考真题","stem":"“We can find our way out safely,” Dad assured us, “____230____ we stay calm and follow the compass direction.”","options":[{"k":"A","v":"as long as"},{"k":"B","v":"even though"},{"k":"C","v":"unless"},{"k":"D","v":"before"}],"answer":"A","clue":"安全脱险的充分保证：“find way out [____] stay calm and follow compass”","analysis":"【充分条件 as long as】暴雨迷失方向时父亲给大家吃定心丸：只要（as long as）大家保持冷静并顺着指南针所指方向前行，我们定能脱险。","hl":["stay calm and follow"]}]},"ch4#5":{"mech":"4.6","name":"复合句引导结构","qs":[{"no":231,"src":"2025·山东泰安·中考真题","stem":"On the playground, Kellen saw the kids ____231____ seemed lonely and friendless before, and they were playing together happily.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"when"},{"k":"B","v":"which"},{"k":"C","v":"who"},{"k":"D","v":"where"}],"answer":"C","clue":"先行词指人且在从句中充当主语：“kids [____] seemed lonely”","analysis":"【定语从句关系代词 who】先行词是 the kids（孩子们，指人），在后面的定语从句中充当谓语动词 seemed 的主语，关系代词必须使用 who。","hl":["seemed lonely"]},{"no":232,"src":"2025·山东青岛·中考真题","stem":"As the sun moves from east to west, the gnomon's shadow changes. That is ____232____ ancient Chinese sundials tell time accurately.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"where"},{"k":"B","v":"when"},{"k":"C","v":"why"},{"k":"D","v":"how"}],"answer":"D","clue":"表语从句解释运作方式机理：“That is [____] sundials tell time”","analysis":"【表语从句引导词 how】前文详细解释了日晷通过影子长短方位变化测算时间的原理过程，后文用 That is how...（这就是日晷如何报时的方式）总结其工作机理。","hl":["sundials tell time"]},{"no":233,"src":"2025·山东威海·中考真题","stem":"Its tongue wraps around the brain to absorb shocks. That is ____233____ woodpeckers can tap wood all day without headaches.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"why"},{"k":"B","v":"when"},{"k":"C","v":"where"},{"k":"D","v":"what"}],"answer":"A","clue":"表语从句解释因果缘由：“That is [____] woodpeckers tap without headaches”","analysis":"【表语从句引导词 why】前文给出了长舌头充当安全带减震的生理构造（原因），后句用 That is why...（这就是为什么啄木鸟不会头痛的原因）引出结果。","hl":["without headaches"]},{"no":234,"src":"2025·浙江·中考真题","stem":"Emma felt ready for the new day. She knew exactly ____234____ she would find waiting for her tomorrow morning: Mom's three loving kisses.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"how"},{"k":"B","v":"when"},{"k":"C","v":"what"},{"k":"D","v":"where"}],"answer":"C","clue":"宾语从句及物动词 find 缺宾语：“knew exactly [____] she would find”","analysis":"【宾语从句连接代词 what】动词 find 是及物动词，从句中缺少待发现的具体内容事物（宾语），冒号后的三枚亲吻直接揭晓了宾语，连接词选 what。","hl":["she would find"]},{"no":235,"src":"2025·江苏宿迁·中考真题","stem":"Amy was so impatient that at first she didn’t believe ____235____ Mr. Green said about nature's own clock.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"how"},{"k":"B","v":"when"},{"k":"C","v":"what"},{"k":"D","v":"where"}],"answer":"C","clue":"宾语从句及物动词 said 缺少说话内容：“believe [____] Mr. Green said”","analysis":"【宾语从句连接代词 what】动词 believe 后跟宾语从句，从句中谓语动词 said 缺少宾语（说了什么内容），连接代词必须使用 what。","hl":["Mr. Green said"]},{"no":236,"src":"2025·山西·中考真题","stem":"Beinao-1 automatically starts working ____236____ it is placed on the surface of the patient’s brain.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"when"},{"k":"B","v":"unless"},{"k":"C","v":"although"},{"k":"D","v":"though"}],"answer":"A","clue":"时间状语触发动作启动：“starts working [____] it is placed”","analysis":"【时间状语从句 when】设备放置在大脑表面是其启动工作的时间节点。当……的时候（when），引导时间状语从句。","hl":["it is placed"]},{"no":237,"src":"2025·四川凉山·中考真题","stem":"When I had difficulty with my math homework, my friends helped me a lot ____237____ I couldn't solve the problem alone.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"why"},{"k":"B","v":"where"},{"k":"C","v":"when"},{"k":"D","v":"what"}],"answer":"C","clue":"时间状语从句：“helped me [____] I couldn’t solve”","analysis":"【时间状语从句 when】在特定情境下获得朋友帮助：“当（when）我一个人无法解出难题的时候”，when 引导时间状语从句。","hl":[]},{"no":238,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"The teacher asked the shy girl ____238____ she could sing the English song in front of the class or not.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"if"},{"k":"B","v":"whether"},{"k":"C","v":"what"},{"k":"D","v":"that"}],"answer":"B","clue":"固定句式搭配：“whether... or not（是否）”","analysis":"【宾语从句 whether... or not】当从句句末出现 or not 时，表示“是否”的从句引导词只能使用 whether，绝对不能使用 if！","hl":[]},{"no":239,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"The Forbidden City is the most magnificent museum ____239____ I have ever visited in my entire life.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"who"},{"k":"B","v":"when"},{"k":"C","v":"that"},{"k":"D","v":"where"}],"answer":"C","clue":"先行词被最高级修饰：“the most magnificent museum [____] I have ever visited”","analysis":"【定语从句 that 专用法则】先行词 museum 前面有形容词最高级 the most magnificent 修饰时，定语从句关系代词只能用 that，不能用 which。","hl":["the most magnificent museum"]},{"no":240,"src":"2025·四川广元·中考真题","stem":"____240____ making sure that Sam was receiving the best medical care, we rushed back to prepare for morning classes.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"After"},{"k":"B","v":"Before"},{"k":"C","v":"While"},{"k":"D","v":"During"}],"answer":"A","clue":"时间先后顺序：“[____] making sure... rushed back to class”","analysis":"【时间介词/连词 After】确认生病同学得到医生悉心照料之后（先发生），我们才安心返回学校准备上课（后发生），先后时序用 After。","hl":["making sure","rushed back to"]}]},"ch5#0":{"mech":"5.1","name":"连续动作物理时序","qs":[{"no":241,"src":"2025·江苏南通·中考真题","stem":"I decided to make the day special. So I baked cupcakes for the party and ____241____ them to look like soft sheep with white cream and candies.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"bought"},{"k":"B","v":"decorated"},{"k":"C","v":"ate"},{"k":"D","v":"ordered"}],"answer":"B","clue":"烘焙后下一道工序时序：“baked cupcakes → [____] them to look like sheep”","analysis":"【动作时序推进】做蛋糕的工序时序链条：第一步在烤箱里烤好蛋糕坯（baked cupcakes），第二步紧接着涂抹奶油和糖果进行“装扮/装饰（decorated）”，使其外表像小羊。","hl":["them to look like"]},{"no":242,"src":"2025·江苏常州·中考真题","stem":"As soon as Kit put her heavy schoolbag down on her desk, she ____242____ up and smiled at everyone, saying, “Hi, I'm Kit!”","options":[{"k":"A","v":"stood"},{"k":"B","v":"lay"},{"k":"C","v":"fell"},{"k":"D","v":"hid"}],"answer":"A","clue":"入座自我介绍时序：“put bag down → [____] up → smiled → said”","analysis":"【课堂动作时序推进】新同学进教室的一连串物理动作：放下书包（put bag down）→ “站立起来（stood up）”向全班微笑打招呼（smiled）→ 开口说话（said）。肢体动作自然顺畅。","hl":[]},{"no":243,"src":"2025·江苏徐州·中考真题","stem":"The cat jumped up and knocked a book right off the high shelf. Peter immediately leaned down and ____243____ it up from the floor.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"picked"},{"k":"B","v":"threw"},{"k":"C","v":"kicked"},{"k":"D","v":"pushed"}],"answer":"A","clue":"物体坠落后的拾取时序：“knocked off → leaned down → [____] it up”","analysis":"【连续动作时序】书本被小猫推落掉在地上（knocked off），彼得弯下腰（leaned down），随后的物理反应必定是将书从地上“捡起来（picked it up）”。","hl":["leaned down"]},{"no":244,"src":"2025·四川广元·中考真题","stem":"We found some warm water in the cup, gently helped Sam sit up, and carefully ____244____ him drink it to reduce his throat pain.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"watched"},{"k":"B","v":"helped"},{"k":"C","v":"stopped"},{"k":"D","v":"refused"}],"answer":"B","clue":"病患照料动作连：“found water → helped sit up → [____] him drink”","analysis":"【护理动作链条】端来温水，扶起虚弱的病人坐直，接下来的一致性护理动作是“协助/帮助（helped）”他喝下去。连续性照料动作环环相扣。","hl":["him drink"]},{"no":245,"src":"2025·黑龙江大庆·中考真题","stem":"Amy heard about the ripe strawberries on the farm. She excitedly ran home, grabbed an empty basket, and ____245____ toward the field.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"hurried"},{"k":"B","v":"slept"},{"k":"C","v":"waited"},{"k":"D","v":"returned"}],"answer":"A","clue":"采摘连贯动作链：“ran home → grabbed basket → [____] toward field”","analysis":"【物理时序推进】听闻消息 → 跑回家拿篮子（grabbed basket）→ 随后的物理动作是马不停蹄提着篮子“奔向/急匆匆赶往（hurried toward）”草莓田。","hl":["ran home, grabbed"]},{"no":246,"src":"2025·湖北武汉·中考真题","stem":"Dad pulled out an emergency blanket, spread it out carefully, and gently ____246____ it over our shivering shoulders to keep us warm.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"put"},{"k":"B","v":"took"},{"k":"C","v":"tore"},{"k":"D","v":"washed"}],"answer":"A","clue":"毛毯保暖动作连：“pulled out blanket → spread it out → [____] over shoulders”","analysis":"【动作时序推进】从背包掏出救生毯（pulled out）→ 在雨中将毛毯展开（spread it out）→ 随后将毛毯“盖在/披在（put it over）”大家发抖的肩膀上。","hl":["blanket, spread it out"]},{"no":247,"src":"2025·辽宁·中考真题","stem":"The dark clouds gathered quickly and heavy rain began to fall. The family quickly ____247____ up the wet picnic blanket and headed for the car.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"packed"},{"k":"B","v":"sold"},{"k":"C","v":"bought"},{"k":"D","v":"cut"}],"answer":"A","clue":"暴雨突降撤退时序：“rain fell → [____] up wet blanket → headed for car”","analysis":"【撤离动作时序】暴雨倾盆不能再继续野餐，全家人的第一紧急动作是“收拾打包（packed up）”被雨淋湿的野餐垫，随后跑向汽车。","hl":["headed for"]},{"no":248,"src":"2025·广西·中考真题","stem":"All of a sudden, the fragile nest fell down from the tall tree! The boy rushed forward and managed to ____248____ it with his two hands.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"catch"},{"k":"B","v":"break"},{"k":"C","v":"throw"},{"k":"D","v":"hide"}],"answer":"A","clue":"高空坠物冲上前救助：“nest fell down → rushed forward → [____] with hands”","analysis":"【突发救助动作时序】鸟巢从高空掉落（fell down），小男孩奋不顾身冲上前去（rushed forward），随后的动作必然是用双手稳稳“接住（catch）”鸟巢救下雏鸟。","hl":["nest fell down"]},{"no":249,"src":"2025·青海·中考真题","stem":"Making noodles was an enjoyable skill. First, he mixed flour and warm water, kneaded the dough smoothly, and then ____249____ it into thin pieces.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"cut"},{"k":"B","v":"painted"},{"k":"C","v":"threw"},{"k":"D","v":"washed"}],"answer":"A","clue":"做面条料理工序链：“mixed flour and water → kneaded dough → [____] into thin pieces”","analysis":"【烹饪工序时序】做手工面条的严密工序：先将面粉加水混合（mixed）→ 揉成光滑面团（kneaded）→ 随后用刀将其“切成（cut）”细细的面条。","hl":["mixed flour and"]},{"no":250,"src":"2025·北京·中考真题","stem":"Grandpa carefully peeled the fresh red apples, sliced them evenly, and ____250____ them into the prepared sweet cake batter.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"mixed"},{"k":"B","v":"drank"},{"k":"C","v":"burned"},{"k":"D","v":"hit"}],"answer":"A","clue":"烘焙工序时序：“peeled apples → sliced them → [____] them into batter”","analysis":"【烘焙工序时序】削皮（peeled）→ 切片（sliced）→ 接下来把苹果片均匀“混合/拌入（mixed）”蛋糕面糊中送入烤箱。","hl":["apples, sliced them"]}]},"ch5#1":{"mech":"5.2","name":"动宾搭配合理性","qs":[{"no":251,"src":"2025·四川资阳·中考真题","stem":"Making a practical schedule every morning helps us reach our goals and ____251____ our school homework on time.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"cancel"},{"k":"B","v":"finish"},{"k":"C","v":"mark"},{"k":"D","v":"find"}],"answer":"B","clue":"动宾搭配与日常任务：“[____] our school homework on time”","analysis":"【动宾搭配】宾语是家庭作业（homework），能够与 on time（准时）合理搭配的及物动词只能是“完成（finish/complete homework）”。","hl":["our school homework on time"]},{"no":252,"src":"2025·江苏常州·中考真题","stem":"Everything changed when an outgoing new girl named Kit ____252____ our class on a Monday morning.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"taught"},{"k":"B","v":"directed"},{"k":"C","v":"protected"},{"k":"D","v":"joined"}],"answer":"D","clue":"转学新生与班级搭配：“new girl [____] our class”","analysis":"【动宾搭配】主语是新转来的学生（new girl），宾语是集体班级（class），表示作为新成员加入集体的动词搭配为 join the class（转入班级）。","hl":["new girl"]},{"no":253,"src":"2025·四川凉山·中考真题","stem":"Lugu Lake is a wonderful place to ____253____ a completely different lifestyle and make pleasant memories.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"keep"},{"k":"B","v":"experience"},{"k":"C","v":"explain"},{"k":"D","v":"borrow"}],"answer":"B","clue":"动宾及物支配关系：“[____] a completely different lifestyle”","analysis":"【动宾地道搭配】宾语是生活方式（lifestyle），在旅游语境中，能够合乎逻辑地支配生活方式的动词是“亲身体验/经历（experience a lifestyle）”。","hl":["a completely different lifestyle"]},{"no":254,"src":"2025·甘肃兰州·中考真题","stem":"Self-confidence is an amazing inner power. It can ____254____ the best potential hidden in all of us.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"take out"},{"k":"B","v":"give out"},{"k":"C","v":"help out"},{"k":"D","v":"bring out"}],"answer":"D","clue":"习惯动宾短语搭配：“[____] the best in sb.（激发某人最好一面）”","analysis":"【固定动宾短语 bring out】bring out the best in sb. 是英语极其地道的经典搭配，意为“使显现、激发出某人最好的一面或最大潜能”。","hl":["the best"]},{"no":255,"src":"2025·山东泰安·中考真题","stem":"Small kindness counts. Giving someone a warm smile on the playground can easily ____255____ a big difference in his life.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"make"},{"k":"B","v":"take"},{"k":"C","v":"do"},{"k":"D","v":"have"}],"answer":"A","clue":"初中高频核心动宾搭配：“[____] a big difference”","analysis":"【核心动宾短语 make a difference】make a difference 意为“产生积极影响/起重要作用”。宾语是 difference 时，及物动词必须搭配 make，绝不能用 do 或 take。","hl":["a big difference"]},{"no":256,"src":"2025·山东青岛·中考真题","stem":"In ancient times, students who performed poorly in the royal examination were severely ____256____ to drink a bowl of dark ink.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"rewarded"},{"k":"B","v":"praised"},{"k":"C","v":"punished"},{"k":"D","v":"invited"}],"answer":"C","clue":"考试考砸承受的被动动作：“performed poorly → were severely [____] to drink ink”","analysis":"【主客体承受合理性】因考试考得极差（performed poorly），被强制喝墨水显然属于承受“惩罚（punished）”。rewarded（奖赏）和 praised（表扬）逻辑颠倒。","hl":["performed poorly"]},{"no":257,"src":"2025·山西·中考真题","stem":"With this smart translation device, paralyzed patients can easily ____257____ the robotic arm just by using their thoughts.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"believe"},{"k":"B","v":"control"},{"k":"C","v":"protect"},{"k":"D","v":"repair"}],"answer":"B","clue":"意念支配机械臂搭配：“using thoughts to [____] the robotic arm”","analysis":"【科技动宾搭配】瘫痪患者通过脑机接口意念支配机械臂执行抓取操作，能够合理支配机械臂（robotic arm）的动词是“控制/操纵（control）”。","hl":["the robotic arm"]},{"no":258,"src":"2025·吉林长春·中考真题","stem":"Persistent self-education and love for reading finally ____258____ Xu Dawei to achieve great success in his life.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"questioned"},{"k":"B","v":"led"},{"k":"C","v":"watched"},{"k":"D","v":"excused"}],"answer":"B","clue":"固定句式与动宾搭配：“[____] sb. to success（引领某人走向成功）”","analysis":"【动词句型 lead sb. to sth.】动词短语 lead sb. to success 意为“引导/带领某人走向成功”。主语品质（读书与自律）引领人生走向辉煌。","hl":[]},{"no":259,"src":"2025·四川乐山·中考真题","stem":"About 2,500 candidates competed fiercely. Finally, Wang Haoze ____259____ all the tough tests and became an astronaut.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"failed"},{"k":"B","v":"passed"},{"k":"C","v":"lost"},{"k":"D","v":"broke"}],"answer":"B","clue":"顺利入选航天员的前提动宾：“[____] all the tough tests → became an astronaut”","analysis":"【动宾搭配 pass tests】后文明确点出她成功入选为航天员，由此反推她对待所有苛刻严酷的选拔考核所达成的动作必然是“通过了测试（passed all the tests）”。","hl":["all the tough tests"]},{"no":260,"src":"2025·湖北武汉·中考真题","stem":"Before entering the deep forest, you should always pack a compass to prevent losing your ____260____ in bad weather.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"mind"},{"k":"B","v":"way"},{"k":"C","v":"balance"},{"k":"D","v":"friend"}],"answer":"B","clue":"指南针的导航功能与固定短语：“compass → prevent losing your [____]”","analysis":"【固定动宾搭配 lose one's way】指南针的作用是指示方向防范迷路，动宾短语 lose one’s way 意为“迷失方向/迷路”，搭配天衣无缝。","hl":["prevent losing your"]}]},"ch5#2":{"mech":"5.3","name":"动词短语与介词骨架","qs":[{"no":261,"src":"2025·四川广元·中考真题","stem":"I had just fallen asleep when Sam groaned. I really wanted to ____261____ sleeping, but his painful cries made it impossible.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"go off"},{"k":"B","v":"go on"},{"k":"C","v":"take on"},{"k":"D","v":"take off"}],"answer":"B","clue":"动词短语接动名词：“[____] doing sth.（继续做某事）”","analysis":"【动词短语 go on】go on doing sth. 意为“继续做某事”。作者刚刚入睡本想“继续睡觉（go on sleeping）”，但室友剧烈的呻吟打断了他。","hl":[]},{"no":262,"src":"2025·四川凉山·中考真题","stem":"As time ____262____ quietly day by day, I grew older and changed my thoughts about the most important things in life.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"went by"},{"k":"B","v":"went back"},{"k":"C","v":"went out"},{"k":"D","v":"went off"}],"answer":"A","clue":"时间流逝固定习语短语：“As time [____]”","analysis":"【固定动词短语 go by】As time went by 是英语描述时光流逝的经典习语，意为“随着时间的流逝”。go back（返回），go out（熄灭/外出）。","hl":[]},{"no":263,"src":"2025·黑龙江大庆·中考真题","stem":"Seeing the empty strawberry field, Amy suddenly ____263____ what her wise teacher had told her about being a doer.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"threw away"},{"k":"B","v":"depended on"},{"k":"C","v":"thought of"},{"k":"D","v":"looked for"}],"answer":"C","clue":"头脑中突然忆起某事：“suddenly [____] what teacher had told”","analysis":"【动词短语 think of】动词短语 think of 表示“想起/回忆起”。面对空荡荡的果园，艾米头脑中突然“想起了（thought of）”老师曾经的谆谆教诲。","hl":["teacher had told"]},{"no":264,"src":"2025·山东菏泽·中考真题","stem":"The next morning, when I ____264____ and walked to my desk, I found a warm letter left by my caring parents.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"put up"},{"k":"B","v":"got up"},{"k":"C","v":"looked up"},{"k":"D","v":"stood up"}],"answer":"B","clue":"清晨作息动作短语：“The next morning, when I [____]”","analysis":"【日常动词短语 get up】时间状语是 The next morning（次日早晨），早晨醒来并走下床走向书桌的作息动作是“起床（got up）”。","hl":["The next morning, when I"]},{"no":265,"src":"2025·江苏徐州·中考真题","stem":"The cat knocked the heavy book to the floor. Peter smiled, walked over, and gently ____265____ the book from the rug.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"gave up"},{"k":"B","v":"got up"},{"k":"C","v":"set up"},{"k":"D","v":"picked up"}],"answer":"D","clue":"拾起物品动词短语：“[____] up the book from the rug”","analysis":"【动词短语 pick up】pick up sth. 意为“捡起/拾起某物”。将掉在毯子上的书捡起来，动词短语只能选 picked up。","hl":["the book from the rug"]},{"no":266,"src":"2025·四川乐山·中考真题","stem":"She had an inspiring family. ____266____ in a family full of love, she learned the importance of diligence from an early age.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"Growing up"},{"k":"B","v":"Waking up"},{"k":"C","v":"Caught up"},{"k":"D","v":"Taken up"}],"answer":"A","clue":"成长环境动词短语：“[____] in a family like that”","analysis":"【动词短语 grow up】grow up in a family 意为“在……样的家庭中长大”。分词短语作状语表示成长历程背景。","hl":["in a family"]},{"no":267,"src":"2025·浙江·中考真题","stem":"Every morning after breakfast, Emma kissed her mother and cheerfully ____267____ the school building with her bag.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"headed for"},{"k":"B","v":"arrived at"},{"k":"C","v":"ended up"},{"k":"D","v":"put off"}],"answer":"A","clue":"出发前往某地动词短语：“[____] the school building with her bag”","analysis":"【动词短语 head for】head for sth. 意为“动身前往/朝……走去”。背起书包精神饱满地朝学校大楼走去，选 headed for。","hl":["the school building with her bag"]},{"no":268,"src":"2025·广东广州·中考真题","stem":"Auditioning a dog for the theatrical play was difficult, but the director refused to ____268____ until he found Lucky.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"give up"},{"k":"B","v":"keep on"},{"k":"C","v":"hear about"},{"k":"D","v":"dream of"}],"answer":"A","clue":"坚持不放弃动词短语：“refused to [____] until found dog”","analysis":"【动词短语 give up】refuse to give up 意为“拒绝放弃/决不轻言放弃”。直到找到合适的小狗演员前绝不放弃，选 give up。","hl":[]},{"no":269,"src":"2025·山东潍坊·中考真题","stem":"Many modern people are becoming increasingly ____269____ various chronic health problems caused by excessive screen time.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"crazy about"},{"k":"B","v":"worried about"},{"k":"C","v":"excited at"},{"k":"D","v":"good at"}],"answer":"B","clue":"对健康危机担忧固定短语：“[____] chronic health problems”","analysis":"【固定搭配 be worried about】be worried about sth. 意为“对……感到担忧/焦虑”。人们对屏幕时间过长带来的健康隐患感到忧虑。","hl":["chronic health problems"]},{"no":270,"src":"2025·山西·中考真题","stem":"The smart mechanical arm can easily ____270____ a glass of water from the kitchen table and hand it to the patient.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"pick up"},{"k":"B","v":"take away"},{"k":"C","v":"give out"},{"k":"D","v":"put off"}],"answer":"A","clue":"抓取物品动词短语：“[____] a glass of water from table”","analysis":"【动词短语 pick up】机械臂执行的操作是从桌上“拿起/抓取（pick up）”一杯水并递给行动不便的患者。","hl":["a glass of water from"]}]},"ch5#3":{"mech":"5.4","name":"非谓语接续规范","qs":[{"no":271,"src":"2025·四川资阳·中考真题","stem":"If you decide to study a foreign language for fifteen minutes every day, you must keep ____271____ it without pausing!","options":[{"k":"A","v":"do"},{"k":"B","v":"to do"},{"k":"C","v":"doing"},{"k":"D","v":"done"}],"answer":"C","clue":"动词 keep 后固定接动名词：“keep doing sth.（坚持做某事）”","analysis":"【非谓语接续·keep doing】动词 keep 支配非谓语动词作宾语时，必须接动名词形式 doing，表达“持续不断地坚持做某事”，绝对不能接 to do！","hl":[]},{"no":272,"src":"2025·黑龙江大庆·中考真题","stem":"When Amy was young, she was always wasting much time getting prepared instead of ____272____ her homework at once.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"do"},{"k":"B","v":"doing"},{"k":"C","v":"to do"},{"k":"D","v":"did"}],"answer":"B","clue":"介词 of 之后必须接动名词：“instead of [____] homework”","analysis":"【非谓语接续·介词后接 doing】instead of 是复合介词短语，其后无论何时出现动词，必须遵循“介词后接动名词（doing）”的铁律。","hl":[]},{"no":273,"src":"2025·四川乐山·中考真题","stem":"From then on, Mark kept ____273____ his guitar every evening, determined to climb over his own personal mountain.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"practice"},{"k":"B","v":"practicing"},{"k":"C","v":"to practice"},{"k":"D","v":"practiced"}],"answer":"B","clue":"动词 keep 后固定接动名词：“kept [____] his guitar”","analysis":"【非谓语接续·keep doing】keep doing sth. 表示“持续做某事”。从那时起马克每晚坚持弹奏吉他，动名词选 practicing。","hl":["his guitar"]},{"no":274,"src":"2025·江苏宿迁·中考真题","stem":"Amy rushed out of the living room and saw Mr. Green ____274____ the damp soil with a protective piece of cloth.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"cover"},{"k":"B","v":"covering"},{"k":"C","v":"to cover"},{"k":"D","v":"covered"}],"answer":"B","clue":"感官动词 see sb. doing sth.（看见某人正在做某事）","analysis":"【非谓语接续·感官动词现在分词】see sb. doing sth. 强调目睹动作正在发生的过程。艾米冲出屋子，正好看见格林先生正在用布遮盖泥土。","hl":[]},{"no":275,"src":"2025·青海·中考真题","stem":"He thought making noodles would be very easy because he often saw his mother ____275____ it in the kitchen.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"do"},{"k":"B","v":"to do"},{"k":"C","v":"did"},{"k":"D","v":"done"}],"answer":"A","clue":"感官动词 see sb. do sth.（经常看见某人做某事，全过程）","analysis":"【非谓语接续·感官动词省略 to 的不定式】see sb. do sth. 强调经常性地看到某人做某事的全过程（often 为习惯性标志），不定式符号 to 必须省略，选动词原形 do。","hl":[]},{"no":276,"src":"2025·湖北武汉·中考真题","stem":"Dad suggested ____276____ on to the sturdy tree branches in order to keep balance on the slippery trail.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"hold"},{"k":"B","v":"holding"},{"k":"C","v":"to hold"},{"k":"D","v":"held"}],"answer":"B","clue":"动词 suggest 后接动名词：“suggest doing sth.（建议做某事）”","analysis":"【非谓语接续·suggest doing】动词 suggest 后面直接跟动词作宾语时，只能接动名词形式 doing，绝对不能接不定式 to do！选 holding。","hl":[]},{"no":277,"src":"2025·山东泰安·中考真题","stem":"Kellen still sees many schoolmates ____277____ the colourful belonging buttons on their winter backpacks.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"wear"},{"k":"B","v":"wearing"},{"k":"C","v":"to wear"},{"k":"D","v":"wore"}],"answer":"B","clue":"感官动词 see sb. doing 强调正在佩戴的状态","analysis":"【非谓语接续·现在分词作补足语】sees schoolmates wearing buttons 描述在校园里目睹同学们身上佩戴着徽章这一进行性画面，选现在分词 wearing。","hl":[]},{"no":278,"src":"2025·江苏徐州·中考真题","stem":"The fantasy daydream was so cool that Peter couldn't stop ____278____ down the exciting adventures in his notebook.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"write"},{"k":"B","v":"writing"},{"k":"C","v":"to write"},{"k":"D","v":"written"}],"answer":"B","clue":"动词短语 couldn't stop doing sth.（忍不住一直做某事）","analysis":"【非谓语接续·stop doing 与 to do 辨析】couldn't stop doing sth. 意为“情不自禁停不下来地一直做某事”。彼得完全停不下来手中的笔，一直写个不停，选 writing。","hl":[]},{"no":279,"src":"2025·四川广元·中考真题","stem":"Robbie and I helped the medical staff safely carry Sam into the hospital after ____279____ an emergency call.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"make"},{"k":"B","v":"making"},{"k":"C","v":"to make"},{"k":"D","v":"made"}],"answer":"B","clue":"介词 after 后接动名词形式：“after [____] a call”","analysis":"【非谓语接续·介词后接 doing】after 在句中作介词，后接打电话的动作作介词宾语，必须使用动名词形式 making。","hl":[]},{"no":280,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"The teacher told us to remember ____280____ our homework notebooks to school tomorrow morning.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"bring"},{"k":"B","v":"bringing"},{"k":"C","v":"to bring"},{"k":"D","v":"brought"}],"answer":"C","clue":"双面动词辨析：“remember to do sth.（记住去做尚未做的事）”","analysis":"【非谓语接续·双面动词深度辨析】remember to do sth. 表示“记住去做某事（动作尚未发生，表将来任务）”；remember doing sth. 表示“记得曾经做过某事（已发生）”。老师提醒明天带作业，选 to bring。","hl":[]}]},"ch5#4":{"mech":"5.5","name":"动词时态与语态","qs":[{"no":281,"src":"2025·江苏南通·中考真题","stem":"When Aunt Jen invited us to the party, I ____281____ extremely excited because our family had never visited a real farm.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"am"},{"k":"B","v":"was"},{"k":"C","v":"will be"},{"k":"D","v":"have been"}],"answer":"B","clue":"从句一般过去时时间锚点：“When Aunt Jen invited us...”","analysis":"【时态一致性】时间状语从句谓语动词 invited 明确锚定故事发生在过去，主句叙述当时的心情必然与全篇过去时基调保持一致，选 was。","hl":["When Aunt Jen invited us"]},{"no":282,"src":"2025·四川凉山·中考真题","stem":"When I was seven years old, my parents ____282____ always with me, giving me endless patience and love.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"are"},{"k":"B","v":"were"},{"k":"C","v":"will be"},{"k":"D","v":"have been"}],"answer":"B","clue":"时间状语锚定过去：“When I was seven years old”","analysis":"【时态与主谓一致】主句主语是复数名词 my parents，时间背景明确为童年过去时（was seven），主句系动词过去式复数选用 were。","hl":["When I was seven years old"]},{"no":283,"src":"2025·青海·中考真题","stem":"The practical living skills that Mr. Li learned in the village ____283____ him greatly in his current daily life.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"help"},{"k":"B","v":"helped"},{"k":"C","v":"will help"},{"k":"D","v":"are helping"}],"answer":"A","clue":"时间状语锚定当前客观事实：“in his current daily life”","analysis":"【一般现在时客观规律】注意时间锚点的跃迁！从句 learned 是过去学的，但主句的时间状语是 in his current daily life（在目前的日常生活中），陈述当前的长期实际效益用一般现在时 help。","hl":["in his current daily life"]},{"no":284,"src":"2025·吉林长春·中考真题","stem":"The unique community library ____284____ by Xu Dawei in 2010 after several years of hard work.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"opens"},{"k":"B","v":"opened"},{"k":"C","v":"was opened"},{"k":"D","v":"is opened"}],"answer":"C","clue":"主语为建筑物且带具体过去年份：“library [____] by Xu in 2010”","analysis":"【一般过去时的被动语态】主语 the library（图书馆）是动作的承受者（不能自己开门创办），时间状语是明确的过去年份 in 2010，故采用一般过去时被动语态 was opened。","hl":[]},{"no":285,"src":"2025·四川乐山·中考真题","stem":"On October 30th, 2024, Wang Haoze and two other astronauts ____285____ into space by the Long March rocket.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"sent"},{"k":"B","v":"was sent"},{"k":"C","v":"were sent"},{"k":"D","v":"are sent"}],"answer":"C","clue":"复数主语承受动作且由火箭发射：“astronauts [____] into space by rocket”","analysis":"【一般过去时复数被动语态】主语是复数航天员，被神舟火箭发射升空，时间是过去的 2024年10月，复数被动语态选用 were sent。","hl":["into space by"]},{"no":286,"src":"2025·山西·中考真题","stem":"Beinao-1 is a revolutionary invention. It ____286____ the international world record in high technology since it was developed.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"breaks"},{"k":"B","v":"broke"},{"k":"C","v":"has broken"},{"k":"D","v":"will break"}],"answer":"C","clue":"时间状语标志：“since it was developed（自被研发以来）”","analysis":"【现在完成时 has done】since 引导一般过去时时间状语从句时，主句必须严格使用现在完成时（have/has + 过去分词），选 has broken。","hl":["since it was developed"]},{"no":287,"src":"2025·山东青岛·中考真题","stem":"Nowadays, the interesting idiom ‘drinking ink’ ____287____ widely to praise people with high education.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"uses"},{"k":"B","v":"used"},{"k":"C","v":"is used"},{"k":"D","v":"was used"}],"answer":"C","clue":"时间副词与被动用法：“Nowadays... idiom [____] widely”","analysis":"【一般现在时被动语态】时间副词 Nowadays（如今）提示当前时代，成语 idiom 作为物充当主语，被广泛使用，故采用一般现在时被动语态 is used。","hl":[]},{"no":288,"src":"2025·山东泰安·中考真题","stem":"“I ____288____ many lonely kids become outgoing since we started our project,” Kellen told the teacher proudly.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"saw"},{"k":"B","v":"have seen"},{"k":"C","v":"see"},{"k":"D","v":"had seen"}],"answer":"B","clue":"时间状语标志：“since we started our project”","analysis":"【现在完成时 have seen】直接引语中由于伴随 since 从句，主句谓语动词必须使用现在完成时，表示从项目发起至今已经见证了诸多积极转变，选 have seen。","hl":["since we started our project"]},{"no":289,"src":"2025·辽宁·中考真题","stem":"Mum tripped over the beach blanket, and the birthday cake ____289____ onto the sand.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"falls"},{"k":"B","v":"fell"},{"k":"C","v":"was fallen"},{"k":"D","v":"is falling"}],"answer":"B","clue":"并列谓语过去时：“tripped over... and [____]”","analysis":"【时态一致性·不及物动词无被动】妈妈被绊倒（tripped，过去式），蛋糕随之掉落在沙滩上，并列谓语用过去式 fell。fall 是不及物动词，严禁使用被动语态！","hl":["tripped over"]},{"no":290,"src":"2025·湖北武汉·中考真题","stem":"When I arrived home safely and sat by the fire, I found that my clothes ____290____ completely wet by the heavy rain.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"are"},{"k":"B","v":"were"},{"k":"C","v":"have been"},{"k":"D","v":"will be"}],"answer":"B","clue":"主句一般过去时宾语从句时态呼应：“found that clothes [____] wet”","analysis":"【主从复合句时态一致性】主句谓语动词 found 是过去时，宾语从句中的系表结构也必须使用一般过去时复数 were。","hl":["found that"]}]},"ch5#5":{"mech":"5.6","name":"代词系统与指代","qs":[{"no":291,"src":"2025·四川凉山·中考真题","stem":"Many important things that keep changing make ____291____ life unexpected, colorful and interesting.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"your"},{"k":"B","v":"our"},{"k":"C","v":"their"},{"k":"D","v":"his"}],"answer":"B","clue":"全文以第一人称复数视角叙事：“as we grow up... make [____] life”","analysis":"【代词性数一致性】首段与末段通篇以第一人称复数 we / us（我们）为思考主体，在总结生活时，修饰生活的名词前对应物主代词必然是“我们的（our life）”。","hl":[]},{"no":292,"src":"2025·山东枣庄·中考真题","stem":"From my experience, I learned to be confident. Believe in ____292____, and I know I will win.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"myself"},{"k":"B","v":"yourself"},{"k":"C","v":"ourselves"},{"k":"D","v":"themselves"}],"answer":"A","clue":"主语为第一人称单数自勉：“Believe in [____], and I will win”","analysis":"【反身代词格位一致】后半句主语是第一人称单数 I，作者自我对话鼓励自己，believe in oneself 结构中对应的反身代词是 myself（相信我自己）。","hl":["I will win"]},{"no":293,"src":"2025·青海·中考真题","stem":"Mr. Li learned cooking as a child. Thanks to ____293____ great living skills, he enjoys a healthier life.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"his"},{"k":"B","v":"its"},{"k":"C","v":"her"},{"k":"D","v":"their"}],"answer":"A","clue":"指代单数成年男性：“Mr. Li → [____] great skills”","analysis":"【形容词性物主代词】指代前文的单数男性主语李老师（Mr. Li），修饰其掌握的生活技能，形容词性物主代词选用 his（他的）。","hl":[]},{"no":294,"src":"2025·浙江·中考真题","stem":"Every morning, Emma received kisses from her mother. Her ____294____ three loving phrases guided Emma through daily challenges.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"friend's"},{"k":"B","v":"mother's"},{"k":"C","v":"sister's"},{"k":"D","v":"teacher's"}],"answer":"B","clue":"前文直接交代发出者：“kisses from her mother”","analysis":"【名词所有格指代】亲吻与叮嘱语言的发出者在前文明确交代是母亲（mother），代词所有格精准对应 mother’s。","hl":["kisses from her mother"]},{"no":295,"src":"中考真题精选·16招题库","stem":"In autumn, my father often takes ____295____ and my little brother to climb the mountain behind our house.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"I"},{"k":"B","v":"me"},{"k":"C","v":"my"},{"k":"D","v":"mine"}],"answer":"B","clue":"及物动词 takes 后接宾格形式：“takes [____] and my brother”","analysis":"【人称代词宾格】takes 是及物动词，动词后面接人称代词充当宾语，第一人称单数必须使用宾格形式 me，绝不能用主格 I 或物主代词 my。","hl":[]}]},"ch5#6":{"mech":"5.7","name":"混淆动词辨析","qs":[{"no":296,"src":"2025·黑龙江大庆·中考真题","stem":"Mr. Thornton said to Amy, “I will ____296____ thirteen cents a kilogram for all the ripe strawberries you pick for me.”","options":[{"k":"A","v":"lend"},{"k":"B","v":"pay"},{"k":"C","v":"lay"},{"k":"D","v":"spend"}],"answer":"B","clue":"句型搭配 pay money for sth.：“pay... for all you pick”","analysis":"【花费动词辨析·pay vs spend】人作主语支付金钱，后接介词 for 锁定搭配结构 sb. pay money for sth.！若用 spend 则必须接介词 on（spend money on sth.），故只能选 pay。","hl":["you pick"]},{"no":297,"src":"2025·山东青岛·中考真题","stem":"An ancient Chinese idiom says that time is more valuable than gold because an inch of time cannot be ____297____ with an inch of gold.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"sold"},{"k":"B","v":"bought"},{"k":"C","v":"borrowed"},{"k":"D","v":"lent"}],"answer":"B","clue":"谚语“寸金难买寸光阴”与介词 with 搭配：“cannot be [____] with gold”","analysis":"【买卖与借贷辨析】buy sth. with money 意为“用金钱购买某物”。谚语“寸金难买寸光阴”翻译为时间无法用黄金来买到（cannot be bought with gold）。","hl":[]},{"no":298,"src":"2025·四川广元·中考真题","stem":"The ambulance rushed to our campus gate. Sam was ____298____ to the emergency hospital room in time for immediate medical treatment.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"taken"},{"k":"B","v":"brought"},{"k":"C","v":"carried"},{"k":"D","v":"fetched"}],"answer":"A","clue":"由近及远送往医院：“[____] to hospital”","analysis":"【带字动词辨析·take vs bring vs fetch】bring 指由远及近“带来”；take 指由近及远“带走/送往”；fetch 指去拿了再回来。救护车将病人从学校送往医院，动作是由近及远，被动语态选 taken。","hl":[]},{"no":299,"src":"2025·广东广州·中考真题","stem":"Auditioning a dog was tough, but the director finally ____299____ to find a talented three-legged dog named Lucky.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"managed"},{"k":"B","v":"tried"},{"k":"C","v":"hoped"},{"k":"D","v":"wished"}],"answer":"A","clue":"克服困难成功办成某事：“finally [____] to find dog”","analysis":"【设法做成与尝试辨析·manage vs try】manage to do sth. 强调经过努力最终成功做成了某事（强调结果成功）；try to do 仅强调努力尝试但不确保结果。后文小狗参演成功印证了结局，选 managed。","hl":[]},{"no":300,"src":"2025·山东威海·中考真题","stem":"How does a woodpecker ____300____ brain damage while tapping wood 12,000 times a day? Its special tongue absorbs the shock.","options":[{"k":"A","v":"get"},{"k":"B","v":"avoid"},{"k":"C","v":"protect"},{"k":"D","v":"cause"}],"answer":"B","clue":"及物动词接伤害宾语：“[____] brain damage（避开脑损伤）”","analysis":"【防范与保护动词辨析·avoid vs protect】宾语是 brain damage（脑损伤，负面结果）。及物动词 avoid 直接加负面宾语表示“避免/规避脑损伤”；若选 protect 必须搭配介词 from（protect brain from damage），故选 avoid。","hl":["brain damage"]}]}};
